<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Dondo Congo</book>
  <para style="h">MAVANGA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mav</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mavanga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mavanga ma Zintumwa</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mavanga ma zintumwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mavanga ma zintumwa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Dii ni buuku dinzole disonika Luka. Dintete ni «Musamu Wumbote wusonika Luka.» Buuku bedidi dina lonka bonso bwedi budidi kisalu ki kisala zintumwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka wuna zonzila mu buuku dintete, mbutukulu yi Yesu, luzingu lwandi ha luse lu butoto, mfwilu andi, mpe bwedi kafulukila mu bafwa na ntombokolo andi ku yulu. Mu buuku bedidi, wuna lonka bwedi Mpeve Yilongo yi kulumukina ku zintumwa, na bwedi bedi kwe zyetedi mu zimbanza mu kwe samuni, mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo, Musamu Wumbote. Wuna zonzila mpe mfyetokoso na mpasi zimvimba zi babwabwana mu kisalu bekyokyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka wuta mu buuku bedidi, bwedi zintumwa zitonina mu samuna Musamu Wumbote ku balembolo ba Bayudayo, mpeleko, mu ntama, Bayudayo bedi banzanga ti ku yawu kaka wufweti samunu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka kisalu ki zintumwa zole kana vula zonzila: Petelo na Pawuli. Petelo wulonga ku bisi-Yelusalemi natee luzingu mu Klisto bu luzakala mu Yelusalemi. Pawuli, yandi wulonga mu zimbanza zi yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, mu balonka nzila yi Klisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buuku bedidi dina tulonka ti tufweti samuna Musamu Wumbote wu Yesu-Klisto mu bibuka bimvimba bi ha luse lu butoto bebubu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi buuku bedidi ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">I. Ndongolo yi Musamu wumbote ku Yelusalemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-8:3">1.1–8.3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Bilumbu binsuka bi Yesu-Klisto ha luse lu butoto bebubu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-11">1.1-11</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Matyase wu soolo mu ba ntumwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 1:12-26">1.12-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Nkwizulu yi Mpeve Yilongo (<char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">4) Zintumwa zina ta kimbangi ki Musamu Wumbote ku Yelusalemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 2:14-8:3">2.14–8.3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">II. Ndongolo yi Musamu Wumbote ku zimbanza zi Yuda na Samaliya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8.4–12.25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">III. Ndongolo yi Musamu Wumbote mu nza yimvimba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13.1–28.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Nzyetolo yintete yi Pawuli mu kwe samuna Musamu Wumbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-14:28">13.1–14.28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Nyuwasani yi ba ku Yelusalemi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15.1-35</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Nzyetolo yinzole yi Pawuli mu kwe samuna Musamu Wumbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:36-18:23">15.36–18.23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Nzyetolo yitatu yi Pawuli mu kwe samuna Musamu Wumbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:24-21:16">18.24–21.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Bakanga Pawuli ku Yelusalemi mpe bamutuula mu boloko (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-23:22">21.17–23.22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Banata Pawuli ku Kayisali (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 23:23-26:32">23.23–26.32</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Banata Pawuli ku mbanza yi Loma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 27:1-28:31">27.1–28.31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zintumwa zibeki nsilulu ye tambula Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mpangi ani Teofile, mu buuku dyani dintete, nazonzila misamu mimvimba mihidika Yesu na mi kalonga tuka ku mbadukulu <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />natee kilumbu ki katomboka ku yulu. Tekila katomboka ku yulu, Yesu mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo, wuhaana ntumunu ku zintumwa zi kasoola. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Ku manima ma lufwa lwandi, wubayenikina, na wubalonka mu bifwani bibingi ti wumoyo kadi. Wubayenikina mu bilumbu makumaya, na wubazonzila misamu mi kimfumu ki Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Mu ntangu yi kedi dya nawu, wubahaana ntumunu eyi ti: «Lubandi kitatu na Yelusalemi ko, kansi kingileeno nsilulu yi lusila Tata, yo yina lusamunina. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yoane wubotika bantu mu mamba, kansi yeno, mwa bilumbu kwandi bi sidi, mbo lubotoko mu Mpeve Yilongo.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntombokolo yi Yesu ku yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Yobobo baba bayonzama ha kimosi na Yesu bamufuula ti: «Mfumu, nganunu ntangu yifweni yi waasa ti kintinu ki Isaeli kivutuka e?»<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu wubavutudila ti: «Kadi musamu eno wudi mu zaba ntangu na kilokola, ki kubika Tata mu lutumu lwandi e? <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Kansi yeno lwaatambula lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo yaakulumuka ku yeno. Mbo luba zimbangi zani ku Yelusalemi, mu kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda na ki Samaliya, natee ku sukina nza.» <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Bu kamanisa mu zonza bobo, wutomboka ku yulu ha meso mawu. Mpe tuti diyiza mufuka na bedi bwesa muyena ko. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Bu bedi talanga ku yulu kwedi yendisa Yesu, bayena babakala bole balwata binkutu bimpembe na bayiza ba bela-bela nawu, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />babateela ti: «Yeno bisi-Ngalili, bila nki luna mana tadilanga ku yulu e? Yesu bewowo wubatombodi ku yulu ha kati dyeno, waavutuka bonso bu luyenini nkwendolo andi ku yulu.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matyase hingani ha kibuka ki Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Bantumwa bavutuka ku mbanza Yelusalemi na basisa mulandu wu nkumbu Olive, wuba bela-bela na Yelusalemi, kampe kilometele yimosi. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Bu bayenda tula, batomboka mu kihinga ki ku yulu mu nzo yi kibanga mu bedi vukininanga. Baba momo ni: Petelo, Yoane, Zaki na Andele, Filipi na Toma, Batelemi na Matayi, Zaki mwana wu Alefe, Simoni mu-Zeloti na Yuda mwana wu Zaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Bamvimba, bedi vukananga ntangu ka ntangu mu sambila ha kimosi na bakento, na Maliya ngudi yi Yesu na mpangi zi Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo kwandi, dibundu diyonzama kampe lutangu nkama na makumole ma bantu. Petelo wutelama ha kati dyawu na wubateela ti: <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«Mpangi zani, bufweni ti mambu maa mu Masonama, masamuna Mpeve Yilongo mu munwa wu Davidi ma lunga, bu kazonzila Yuda wuba kinati ki yobobo babwila Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yandi wuba wumosi ha kati dyeto na wusala kintwadi neto. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Kansi wusumba mfuba mu mbongo zi bamufuta mu dyambu dimbi di kahidika. Wubwila ki mutu, mboki moyo wumupasuka ha kati-kati mpe midya myandi mimvimba mi sangamana. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Bisi- Yelusalemi bamvimba bazaba musamu bewowo. Ni hahoho bahaanina mfuba beyoyo nkumbu mu ndinga awu ti “Akeledama” mpila mosi ti: “mfuba yi menga”.» <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Wusonama mu buuku di mikunga ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">«Bika banyafuna nzo andi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Na kani muntu kalendi zakala momo ko!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Mpe wusonama dyaka ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">Bika muntu wuhiika kasala kisalu kyandi!<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />«Ni hahoho, tufweti soola muntu wumosi ha kati di yobobo baba neto kintwadi mu ntangu Mfumu Yesu yi kedi kwe zyetingi ha kimosi neto, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />tuka ntangu yi mu botika Yoane natee kilumbu ki bamukatula ha kati dyeto mu mutombola ku yulu. Bufwanakani ti wumosi ha kati dyawu ka ba neto kintwadi mu samunanga kimbangi ki mfulukulu andi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ni hahoho, batedimisina bantu bole: Yosefi wuba kwe tumisinanga ti Basabase hoti Yusutuse, na Matyase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ku manima, minkwikidi mi sambila ebu: «Mfumu, ngeye zebi mitima mi bantu bamvimba, tulonka wumosi wusoodidi mu yababole bebaba <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />mu sala kisalu ki buntumwa kisidi nyafuna Yuda bu kayenzi ku kibuka kyandi ki mufwanakani.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Bu bata hwadi, nsololo yibwa mu Matyase, ni bamukotisa mu kabu di zintumwa kumi na yimosi.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nyizulu yi Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Kilumbu ki mukembo wu Pentekoti bu kifwana, minkwikidi mimvimba mi ba miyonzama ha kibuka kimosi. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Lusuku lufuma ku yulu bonso kitembo kingolo lutumbu kwiza fuluka mu nzo yimvimba yi baba bazakala. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Bayena bifwani bi ludimi bonso milaka mi tiya myedi kwe hambani na ku tentama ha yulu mutu wu kadi muntu mu yawu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Bamvimba bafuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo, na batona mu zonza ndinga zihiika bonso Mpeve kedi twadisila kadi muntu mu zonza.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Ku Yelusalemi kuba na Bayudayo baba bakwikama mu Nzambi, bafuma mu nsi zimvimba zii nza. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Mu lusuku belolo luyuwakana, mpumbu yi bantu yiyiza yonzama. Bamvimba batoma yituku, mu dyambu ti kadi muntu wedi bayuwa mu ndinga andi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Bantu bedi pamuka na bedi yituku bubwingi, mboki bata ti: «Bantu bebobo bana zonza, bamvimba badi bisi-Ngalili ko e? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Bwedi bulendi bela ti kadi muntu ha kati dyeto ka bayuwa mu ndinga andi yi bwala e? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Ha kati dyeto, kuu na bantu bafumini mu nsi zi Pate, Mede na Elami. Kuu na bahiika bafumini ku bizunga bi Mezopotami, Yuda na Kapadose, Ponti na Aziya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />ku Filizi na Pamfili, ku Ngipiti na bantu ba ku kizunga ki Sileni mu nsi yi Libi mpe yobobo bafumini ku mbanza yi Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />ku Kelete na ku Alabi. Kuu na Bayudayo na banzenza bakota mu dibundu di Bayudayo, mpe bamvimba tuna bayuwa bu bana zonza misamu mingitukulu mi Nzambi mu zindinga zeto.»<verse eid="ACT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Bamvimba bayituku na madyela matumbu bahwa. Bedi fulasananga yawu na yawu ti: «Misamu bemimi nki mitiidi mu ta e?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kansi bahiika bedi seya minkwikidi ni bata ti: «Malamu mawu bakololo.»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinzonzi ki Petelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Petelo ni katelama na zintumwa kumi na yimosi, wuzonza mu ndinga yingolo ti: «Yeno bantu ba kizunga ki Yuda na yeno bamvimba luu ha mbanza yi Yelusalemi, bakuleeno misamu bemimi mina hyoka na zibuleno makutu meno mu yuwa misamu mi myani.» <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Bantu bebobo baa bakolo ko bonso bu luna banzila wo, mu dyambu ti kyakidi kwandi kilokola kivwa yi mene. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Kansi bwabu misamuna mumbikudi Yoeli myenzi detila:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Nzambi wuta ti: Mu bilumbu binsukunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mbo nadukula Mpeve ani ku bantu bamvimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">baala beno ba babakala na babakento bana bikula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">zintwenya zeno zaayena mu mbweno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">mpe bihunda byeno baayena mu ndozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ninga, mu bilumbu bebyobyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">mbo nadukula Mpeve ani ku bisadi byani bi babakala na bi bakento,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:18">mpe baabikula.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Mbo nalonka bimangu ku mazulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">na bidimbu ha butoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">menga, tiya na tuti di mwisi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Ntangu yaakituka tombe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">na ngonda yaakituka menga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">tekila kilumbu ki Mfumu kituula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:20">kilumbu kikinene na ki nkembo.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Buna wonso muntu waasambila mu nkumbu yi Mfumu, waabaka mpulusu.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Bisi-Isaeli, yuweeno misamu mi nina luteela: Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti wuba muntu Nzambi wukasadila mu lulonka lulendo mu bidimbu na bimangu bi kasa ha kati dyeno, bonso bu luzabidi wo. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Muntu bewowo, bamuyekola bonso bu ba nzengolo yi Nzambi na bu kakubikila wo tuka ntama. Mboki, yeno lumuhonda bu lumukomisa ha kulunsi mu moko ma minsumuki. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kansi Nzambi wumufulukisa, mu mukuula mu mpasi zi lufwa, mu dyambu ti lufwa lulendi musimbidila ku nsye lulendo lwandi ko. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Davidi wakata mu dyambu dyandi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">Ntangu ka ntangu nedi yenanga Mfumu ha ntadisi ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">mu dyambu ti wuu ha lweka lu kooko kwani ku lubakala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">mwanki na lembolo tekita.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ni hahoho, mutima ani wuu wutoma yangalala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">mpe nina yimbila mu kyese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">nitu ani mpe yaavunda mu kivuvu,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />mu dyambu ti wulendi nsisa ku nsi yi bafwa ko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:27">Waabika ko ti nitu yi kisadi kyaku kilongo yibodila mu ndyamu ko.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Ngeye ndonkidi nzila zikwe haananga luzingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:28">ngeye waamfulusa mu kyese ha meso maku.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Mpangi zani, mbeki luve mu luteela mu kedika kimvimba myo mitadidi mbuta Davidi: yandi wufwa, bamuzika mpe natee mu kilumbu bekiki, ndyamu andi ya kii kwa neto kuku. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Mumbikudi kaba, na wuzaba ti Nzambi wumusila nsilulu mu ndefi ti wumosi mu nkuna andi waamuhingana ha kyandu kyandi ki kintinu. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Davidi wukiyenina mfulukulu mu bafwa yi Klisto. Ni hahoho kazonzila ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">Nzambi kaamusisa mu nsi yi bafwa ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">Mpe kaatala ko ti nitu andi yibola mu kati di ndyamu.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ni Yesu bewowo, Nzambi wukafulukisa mu bafwa nina zonzila, mpe yeto bamvimba zimbangi tudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Nzambi wumuzangula mu kooko kwandi ku lubakala, mpe wutambula Mpeve yi Longo yi musila Tata nsilulu. Mboki, yandi mwangisi yo bonso bu luna yena mpe bu luna yuwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Mpeleko Davidi kayenda ku mazulu ko, kansi yandi wuta ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">Mfumu Nzambi wuta ku Mfumu ani ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">«Yiza zakala ha lweka lu lubakala lwani,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />natee bu nasa ti mitantu myaku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:35">miba bitentokolo bi bitambi byaku.»<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />«Ni hahoho, bika ti kanda dimvimba di Isaeli dibakula kikedika kimvimba ti Yesu yondowo wulukoma ha kulunsi, Nzambi Yandi kazangudi na weka Mfumu na Mesiya.»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Bu bamana yuwa misamu bemyomyo, mitima myawu mi lwala, ni bafuula Petelo na ntumwa zikaka ti: «Mpangi zeto, nki tu fweni sa e?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petelo wubavutudila ti: «Viluleeno madyela: kadi muntu katambula mbotokolo mu nkumbu yi Yesu-Klisto mu dyambu di ndemvokolo yi masumu mandi, na mbo lutambula munkayulu wu Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Mu dyambu ti nsilulu ku yeno na ku baala beno Nzambi kasila yo, ku bamvimba bebobo baa kukula, na ku bamvimba bebobo baatumisa Mfumu Nzambi eto.»<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Mu mpova dyaka zizingi, Petelo wubateela kimbangi na wubakindisa. Wuta ti: «Tineeno kweno mbandu beyiyi yivilangana.» <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Yobobo batambula mambu ma Petelo babotoko. Mpe kilumbu bekyokyo, mafunda matatu ma bantu mabwesama mu kabu di minkwikidi.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dibundu dintete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Batatamana mu yuwa ndongosolo yi zintumwa, mu kintwadi ki zimpangi, mu mbukununu yi dimpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbukununu yi dimpa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kudya bindya bi kintwadi na kudya ha meza ma Mfumu</char></note>, na mu lusambulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Bamvimba bayiza ba na bunkuta mu dyambu di bidimbu na bimangu bibingi byedi hilama mu nzila yi zintumwa. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Bamvimba bakwikila, bayiza ba muntu wumosi na babunda ha kimosi bimvimba bi ba nawu. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Bedi yadikanga mpangu zawu na bimvwama byawu, na bedi kabulanga mpe mbongo zibedi bakanga mu kintwadi bonso bubela nsatu zi muntu-muntu. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Kadi kilumbu batatamana mu vukana mu nzo-Nzambi. Mu kintwadi, bedi kabulanga ha kimosi dimpa mu zinzo, mpe mu kyese na mu mutima wukuluka bedi dilanga bindya byawu. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Bedi kembilanga Nzambi, mpe bantu bamvimba bedi batyanga. Kadi kilumbu, Mfumu wedi bwesanga mu kabu dyawu yobobo bedi bakanga mpulusu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lunyakusu lu muntu wuba na kyeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Petelo na Yoane batomboka ku nzo-Nzambi mu ntangu yi lusambulu mu kilokola ki tatu ku manima ma ntangu ambata. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Kuba na bakala dimosi diba na kyeta tuka mbutuka andi. Kadi kilumbu, bedi munangunanga na bedi muzakikanga ha mwelo wu nzo-Nzambi, wu bakwe tumisinanga ti «Mwelo wuntoko» mu sanga mundombila ku yobobo bedi kotanga mu nzo-Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Bu kayena Petelo na Yoane bedi saka kota mu nzo-Nzambi, wubalomba mbongo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petelo na Yoane bamusungimina naswii, Petelo ni kamuteela ti: «Toma tutala!» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Bakala bende ni kabasungimina, na wedi banza ti waabaka mwa kima ku yawu. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kansi Petelo wumuteela ti: «Nii na mbongo hoti wola ko. Kansi kima kii nani, kyanina kuhaana: mu nkumbu Yesu-Klisto mwisi-Nazaleti, telama na dyata!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Mboki, wumusimba mu kooko ku lubakala na wumutedimisa. Hansi na nsi, malu na makoto mandi matumbu baka ngolo. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Wudumuka na wutumbu telama, mpe ni katona mu dyata. Wukota mu nzo-Nzambi ha kimosi na zintumwa buna wuna kwe dyati, wuna kwe dumuki na wuna kwe kembidi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Bantu bamvimba bamuyena bu kedi kwe dyati na kwe kembidi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Bu babakula ti ni muntu bewowo wedi zakalanga ha Mwelo Wuntoko wu Nzo-Nzambi mu sanga mundombila, bamvimba bayituku na bayiza ba na bunkuta mu dyambu di misamu bemyomyo mi mutudila.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo wuna longa mu nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Bakala bedyodyo kedi bwesa tatukila Petelo na Yoane ko. Mukangu wumvimba wu bantu wuyituku na wuyenda bazungidila mu ntiinu mu kati di musampa wubedi tumisinanga ti musampa wu Solomo. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petelo bu kayena bobo, wuta ku mukangu ti: «Yeno bisi-Isaeli, mu dyambu di nki luna yituku mu lunyakusu belulu e? Bila nki luna tutadila bonso ti mu lulendo lu yeto bende hoti mu kukangama kweto mu Nzambi tusidi ti muntu bewuwu kenda dyati e? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Nzambi yi Abalahami, yi Isaaki na yi Yakobi, Nzambi yi zinkaka zeto, kembisi kisadi kyandi Yesu, wuluyekola ku zimfumu na wulubisa ha ntadisi yi Pilatu, mpeleko yandi wuba na lukanu mu muyambula. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Kansi yeno lubisa muntu wulongo, na wulunungu mpe lulomba kweno baluyambudila mumpondi wu bantu. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Yeno luhondisa Mfumu yikwe haananga luzingu, kansi Nzambi wumufulukisa mu bafwa, mpe yeto tudi zimbangi. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ni kiminu mu nkumbu yi Yesu kiheeni ngolo ku muntu bewuwu wu luna tala na wu luzebi. Ni kiminu mu Yesu kinyakisi muntu bewuwu ha meso ma yeno bamvimba.»<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />«Mpangi zani, bwabu nzebi ti yeno na mintwadisi myeno ku nsye bunzimbu luba bu luhidika musamu bewowo. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kansi Nzambi wulungisila bobo mambu maa kasamuna mu munwa wu mimbikudi mimvimba ti: Mesiya fweti yena mpasi. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Viluleeno madyela bwabu na vutukeeno ku Nzambi mwanki masumu meno malemvokolo. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Buna, Mfumu waaluhaana bilokola bi mvundulu mu Yesu, na waalutambikila Klisto wu kalusoodila tuka ntama. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Ni yandi yulu kafweti tambula natee mu ntangu yi kasa ti bima bimvimba bi kituka bimoona, bonso busamuna wo Nzambi mu munwa wu mimbikudi myandi milongo mu ntama. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Mose mpe wakata ti: “Mfumu Nzambi waasoola ha kati dyeno wumosi mu zimpangi zeno waaba mumbikudi bonso meno. Mbo lumuyuwila mu mimvimba mi kaaluteela. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Mpe wonso muntu waalembolo yuwila mumbikudi bewowo, baamukatula mu kanda di Nzambi na baamuhonda.” <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Mimbikudi mimvimba mizonza, tuka Samueli natee myo milanda, mi kisamunina mpe misamu mina hyoka bilumbu bebibi. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Ni yeno ludi baala ba mimbikudi na ba luwawanu lutunga Nzambi na matata meno mu ntangu yi kata ku Abalahami ti: “Mu dyambu di nkuna aku, makanda mamvimba ma ha butoto mana tambula lusakumunu.” <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ku yeno ntete Nzambi kayenikisa kisadi kyandi, wumutambika mu lusakumuna na mu tatula kadi muntu mu nkadulu zandi zimbi.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Petelo na Yoane ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Mu ntangu Petelo na Yoane yi bedi zonzanga ku mukangu, zinganga-Nzambi, mfumu yi minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi na basaduki bayiza. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Batoma fwema bu bayena Petelo na Yoane bana longisa mukangu na bana samuna mfulukulu mu bafwa mu nkumbu yi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Bababwila na babatuula mu boloko natee kilumbu kilanda, mu dyambu ti bwisi bu kiyidila. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kansi babingi mu yobobo bayuwa ndongosolo awu bakwikila, kampe baba lutangu mafunda matanu ma bantu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Kilumbu kilanda, zimfumu zi Bayudayo, zimbuta zi bantu na milongisi mi Misiku bakutakana ku Yelusalemi, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />na Ana mfumu yi zinganga-Nzambi, Kayifa, Yoane, Alezandeli na bantu bamvimba ba mu kanda di mfumu nganga-Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Balomba babatwadila Petelo na Yoane ha ntadisi awu. Bu batula, batona mu bafuula ti: «Mu lutumu lu nani hoti mu nkumbu yi nani luhidikidi musamu bewuwu e?» <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Petelo, wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo, wubateela ti: «Mfumu zi mukangu na yeno zimbuta zi bantu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />bubedidi bana tuvwika byuhu mu dyambu di musamu wumbote wu tuhidikidi ku muntu wu kyeta. Bana tulomba mpe mu zaba bwedi muntu bewowo kanyakini. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Bika yeno bamvimba na kanda dimvimba di Isaeli luzaba wo ti: ni mu nkumbu yi Yesu-Klisto, mwisi-Nazaleti, yondowo wulukoma ha kulunsi mpe Nzambi wukafulukisa mu bafwa, ni mu yandi muntu bewuwu katelamani ha ntadisi eno na mavimpi mambote. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">“Tadi dinyafuna, yeno, bituungi bi nzo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">dyeka tadi divudidi mfunu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kunani mpulusu ku muntu wukaka ko, mu dyambu ti kunaani nkumbu yi kaka ha nza yi bahaana ku bantu, yilenda tuhaana mpulusu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Mbuta zi bantu zi Bayudayo ziyituku bu bayena kivuvu ki Petelo na Yoane, mu dyambu ti bazaba ti yawu bantu balembolo longoka mikanda na ba bazaba ti ha kimosi bedi kwe bengi na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kansi, bu bayena mpe muntu bewowo wunyaka ha ntendo awu, babaka dyaka dyambu dye vutula ko. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Ba balomba baduuka mu nzo yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, mboki yawu na yawu basala mu yuwasana <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />mpe bateelasana ti: «Nki twaasa ku bantu bebaba e? Mu dyambu ti kimangu kingitukulu basidi, mpe bisi-Yelusalemi bamvimba watomini zaba bumbote na tulendi bisa wo ko. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mwanki musamu bewuwu wulembolo mwangana ha kati di mukangu, tubakanikina mu ngolo zimvimba mulembolo bwesa zonzila mu nkumbu yi Yesu ku kani muntu.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Mboki babatumisa dyaka mu nzo, ni babakanikina mu ngolo zimvimba mu zonzila hoti mu longila mu nkumbu yi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Kansi Petelo na Yoane babavutudila ti: «Nkye dyambu dii didedama ha meso ma Nzambi, kulutumimina hoti kutumimina Nzambi e? Haaneeno mvutu yeno bende. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Yeto mwanki, tulendi bika mu zonzila misamu mituyeni na mituyudi ko.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Mbuta zi bantu zi Bayudayo babavumisa dyaka, ni babayambula benda. Babaka kibila kye basembila ko mu dyambu di mukangu. Mpe Mukangu wumvimba wedi kembila Nzambi mu musamu bewowo wuhilama. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Muntu bewowo wunyaka mu kimangu bekyokyo, wuba wukula kuhyoka mvula makumaya.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusambulu lu minkwikidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bu batumbu babiika, Petelo na Yoane bayenda ku bela bakundi bawu, mpe babayadila mimvimba mi bateela mfumu zinganga-Nzambi na zimbuta zi bantu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Bu bayuwa misamu bemyomyo, kumanima basambila Nzambi mu mutima wumosi ti: «Mfumu, ngeye wuhidika mazulu, butoto, mubu na bima bimvimba bii mu kati. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Ngeye wuta mu nzila yi Mpeve Yilongo, mu munwa wu nkaka eto Davidi, kisadi kyaku ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“Mu dyambu di nki zinsi zinangumukina e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">Bila nki bantu basidi mfundu, kansi zilembolo ba ndandu e?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Ntinu zi ha butoto zitelamani mu nwana mvita</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">mpe zimfumu zibundani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">mu nwanisa Mfumu na Mesiya andi.”<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Wu kedika wudi ti Helode na Ponso Pilatu, babundani ha kimosi mu mbanza beyiyi, na mintwadisi mi zinsi zinzenza na mukangu wu Isaeli, mu nwanisa Yesu kisadi kyaku kilongo, yondowo wu wubyeka. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Bahidika mimvimba bemyomyo mu lungisa makani maku ma wukubika ntama mu lulendo na mu luzolo lwaku. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Mfumu, tala bwedi bana tufyetikisila, bwabu haana ku bisadi byaku kibakala kye samunina mambu maku mu kivuvu kimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Lambula kooko kwaku mu nyakisa bimbevo, mu sa bidimbu na bimangu mu nkumbu yi Yesu, kisadi kyaku ki longo.» <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Bu bamanisa mu sambila, kibuka kibayonzimina, kizakama. Bamvimba bafuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo ni bedi longanga Mambu ma Nzambi mu kivuvu kimvimba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kintwadi ki bantu bakwikama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Bamvimba bakwikila baba mutima wumosi na mabanza mamosi. Kuba muntu wumosi ko wedi kadiminanga bima byandi ti bi yandi bende. Kansi, bimvimba ha kimosi bedi tuulanga byo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Mu lulendo lungitukulu zintumwa ziteela kimbangi ki mfulukulu mu bafwa yi Mfumu Yesu, mpe Nzambi wuhaana ku yawu bamvimba lusakumu luhyokidi kitezo. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Ka muntu ko ha kati dyawu wukondo kima kimfunu. Kedika, yobobo baba na zimfuba hoti zinzo, bayadika zo na batwala mbongo zi bayadikila zo <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />ha ntadisi yi zintumwa. Kadi muntu wedi tambulanga kikunku ki mbongo bonso bubela nsatu zandi.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yosefi, mu-Leviti wumosi wubutuka ku kizanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kizanga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kizunga ki kibuma ki butoto kizungululu mu mamba</char></note> ki Sipeli, yondowo zintumwa wubahaana nkumbu yi Banabase, (mpila mosi ti:Yondowo kwe syamisanga), <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />wuyadika butoto bu ba nandi na wuyenda haana mbongo ku zintumwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ananiase na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Ananiase na mukento andi Safila bayuwasana mu yadika lupangu lwawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Wuyuwasana na mukento andi mu sweka ndambu yi mbongo. Ni kanata ndambu yisala ku zintumwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Ananiase, bwedi yambudidi ti Satana kakota mu mutima aku mu huna Mpeve Yilongo mpe swekidi ndambu yi mbongo zi wuyadikidi lupangu e? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Tekila wu yadika lo, lu lwaku kwandi lu bedi, mboki buyadikidi lo, mbongo zaku kwandi zibedi, kabwa ko e? Bwedi lendi hidikila musamu wubobo ku nsye mutima aku e? Ka yeto ko hunini, kansi Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bu kayuwa mpova bezozo, Ananiase wubwa ha nsi na wufwa. Mboki bamvimba bayuwa wo bayiza ba na bunkuta bubwingi. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ntwenya ziyiza zinga nitu andi mulele, na ziyenda mu kwe mu zika.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Ku manima ma bilokola bitatu, mukento andi wuyiza kota, kazaba musamu wuhyoka ko. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petelo wumufuula ti: «Nteeleti, mu ntalu beyiyi luyadikidi lupangu lweno e?» Wuvutula ti: «Ninga, mu ntalu beyoyo.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petelo ni kamuteela ti: «Bwedi lulendi yuwasana mu tonta Mpeve yi Mfumu e? Yuwa, yobobo babedi mu kwe ziika mulumi aku, yabobo beka mpe ha mwelo, mpe bana kunata mpe.» <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Hansi na nsi, wubwa ha malu ma Petelo na wufwa. Zintwenya bu zikota na zimubwana wufwa, mboki zimunata mu kwe muziika ha ntendo mulumi andi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Dibundu dimvimba na yobobo bamvimba bayuwa misamu bemyomyo, bayena bunkuta bubwingi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bimangu bi zintumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Zintumwa zihidika bidimbu bingitukulu na bimangu ha kati di bantu. Bamvimba bedi vukananga ha kimosi ku nsye musampa wu Solomo. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ka muntu ko wusosa mu ba kintwadi nawu, mpeleko mukangu wedi basiikanga bubwingi. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Lutangu lu bakento na babakala bedi bakwikila mu Mfumu lwedi bwesamanga kadi ntangu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Bantu bedi totola zimbevo mu nzila zilambalala ha mbuka na ha nkwala, mwanki Petelo bu kahyoka, kinsinsya kyandi kifuka kani wumosi mu yawu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Bantu babingi mpe bedi fumanga mu mabwala ma ba bela-bela na Yelusalemi. Bedi natanga zimbevo na bantu bedi kwamusungu ku mpeve zimbi. Mpe bamvimba bedi nyaka.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zintumwa mu kati di mfyetokoso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Buna Mfumu nganga-Nzambi na yobobo bamvimba baba nandi kintwadi, mpila mosi ti bantu baa mu kabu di basaduki, bafuluka mu musoki, ni babaka lukanu mu tedimina musamu bewowo. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ni hahoho, bakangusu zintumwa na babatuba mu boloko di bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kansi mu mpimpa, mbazi yi Mfumu yiyiza zibula myelo mi nzo yi boloko, yiduukisa zintumwa na yibateela ti: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Yendeeno ku nzo-Nzambi mpe samuneeno ku mukangu mambu mamvimba matadidi luzingu lumona.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Bu bayuwa bobo, zintumwa ziyenda kota mene na mene mu nzo-Nzambi na batona mu longa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mfumu nganga-Nzambi na yobobo baba nandi kintwadi bakutikisa kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo na mbuta zi bantu zi Bayudayo. Mboki, batambika bantu benda babonga zintumwa ziba mu boloko.<verse eid="ACT 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Kansi minkengi bu miyenda tuula ku boloko, bayena zintumwa ko. Bu bavutuka, ni bayala mpolo ti: <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />«Twenzi bata boloko ditoma kangama, mpe minkengi mitelama ha myelo mina sala kisalu kyawu. Kansi bu tuzibudi myelo, tuyeni muntu mu kati ko.» <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Mfumu yi minkengi mi nzo-Nzambi na zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi bu bayuwa bobo, madyela matumbu bahwa na bafulasana yawu na yawu mu zaba nkye musamu wu babwididi. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kansi muntu wumosi wuyiza bateela ti: «Yuweno! Bantu balutudidingi mu boloko, mu nzo-Nzambi badi na bana longa mukangu.»<verse eid="ACT 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ni hahoho, mfumu yi minkengi ha kimosi na mbulu-mbulu zandi, bayenda balanda mu malembe, mu dyambu ti bayena bunkuta bu mukangu ti mbo wubawinda matadi. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Bu babavutula, babanata ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo. Mboki, mfumu nganga-Nzambi wubafundisa ti: <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />«Wu nsiki na nsiki tuludika mu longa mu nkumbu yi muntu bewowo. Kansi yeno lumwangisi malongi meno mu mbanza yimvimba yi Yelusalemi. Buna lutidi mu tula ha yulu mutu eto lufwa lu muntu bewowo.»<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petelo na zintumwa bavutula ti: «Bufweni mu tumimina Nzambi, kansi ka bantu ko.» <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Nzambi yi zinkaka zeto wufulukisa Yesu mu bafwa, yondowo yeno wuluhondoso bu lumukoma ha kulunsi. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Nzambi yandi kazangula ku kooko kwandi ku lubakala bonso Mfumu na Muvuukisi mu haana ku Isaeli mvilulu yi madyela na ndemvokolo yi masumu. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Yeto zimbangi zi misamu bemyomyo tudi, bumosi mpe na Mpeve Yilongo yi haana Nzambi ku yobobo bakwe mutumiminanga.<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Bafwema mu mpova bezozo na basosa mu bahondoso. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kansi ha kati dyawu haba na mufalisi wumosi nkumbu andi Ngamalyeli, mulongisi wu Misiku mpe bantu bamvimba bedi toma muvuminanga. Wutelama ha kati di kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, wulomba baduukisa zintumwa mwa ntangu yifyoti ku mbazi, <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />mboki wuta ti: «Bantu ba-Isaeli kebeno kweno mu myo mi luna saka hidika ku bantu bebaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ka ntama yiyingi ko, muntu wumosi wuyenika nkumbu andi Tedasi, wedi kilonka ti yandi ni yandi, na bantu nkamaya bamulanda. Kansi, bamuhonda. Bamvimba bebobo mpe bedi kwe mulandi bamana mwangana, na kusala dyaka muntu ko. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Ku manima mandi, mu ntangu ye zaba lutangu lu bantu, ku yiza yenika mpe Yuda, mwisi-Ngalili. Wukukumuna bantu babingi mu mulanda. Kansi yandi mpe bamuhonda, na yobobo bamulanda, bamana mwangana. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Bwabu nina luteela, lulandandi dyaka bantu bebaba ko na babikeno benda kwawu. Tala ti kisalu kyawu mu kimuntu bana sadila kyo, kyaafwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kansi tala ti ku Nzambi kifumini, lwaalenda mu honda kyo ko. Kebeeno kweno mu nwanisa Nzambi.» Ni bamuyuwila. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Bu batumisa dyaka zintumwa, babazubusu bikoti na babakanikina mu zonzila mu nkumbu yi Yesu. Ku manima, bababika benda kwawu.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Zintumwa zisisa nzo yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, baba mu kyese ki babayenisina mpasi mu dyambu di nkumbu yi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Mpe kadi kilumbu mu nzo-Nzambi na mu zinzo, yawu babika ko mu longa na mu samuna Musamu Wumbote wu Yesu Mesiya.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Nsoodolo yi babakala nsambwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, lutangu lu milongoki lubwesama. Bayudayo bakwe zonzanga ndinga yi kingeleke banyungutila Bayudayo bakwe zonzanga ndinga yi kihebeleo mu dyambu ti bedi zimbakananga mafoola mawu mu nkabululu yi bindya bi kadi kilumbu. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ni hahoho, zintumwa kumi na zole zikutikisa milongoki mimvimba na zihaana ndombolo eyi: «Kambote ko ti yeto tubiika mu samuna Mambu ma Nzambi mu dyambu di nkabululu yi bindya ha meza. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ni hahoho zimpangi zeto, bufwanakani lusoola ha kati dyeno babakala nsambwadi bazabakana mu nsalulu awu yimbote mpe bafuluka mu ndwenga na mu Mpeve Yilongo, mwanki tubahaana kisalu bekyokyo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Yeto, mbo tutatamana mu lusambulu na mu longa Mambu ma Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Dibundu dimvimba ditambula ndombolo beyoyo. Ni basoola Tyeni, muntu wu wufuluka mu kiminu na mu Mpeve Yilongo, Filipi, Polokoli, Nikanoli, Timoni, Palamenasi na Nikola mwisi-Antiose wukota mu dibundu di Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Ku manima, babanata ha ntadisi yi zintumwa. Zintumwa zibasambidila na zibatentika moko. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Mambu ma Nzambi matatamana mu mwangana bubwingi. Mpe lutangu lu milongoki lwedi bwesamanga bubwingi ku Yelusalemi, na Nganga-Nzambi zizingi zi kwikila mu Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakengi Tyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Tyeni wuba wufuluka mu kiminu na mu lulendo. Wedi hidikanga bidimbu bingitukulu na bimangu ha kati di mukangu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo yi bakwe tumisinanga ti: «Nzo yi lusambulu yi Mindongo mibeki kimpwanza», mpe bisi-Sileni na bisi-Alezandi, ha kimosi na Bayudayo ba ku Silisi na ku Aziya bedi yumana na Tyeni. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kansi balembakana mu mubedisa, mu dyambu ti wuzonza mu ndwenga zi muhaana Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ni hahoho, bahaanina nsye kooko ku bantu mwanki ba ta ti: «Tumuyudingi buna wuna safula Mose na Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Ni basa ti mukangu, bakuluntu na milongisi mi Misiku banangumuka. Ku manima, babwila Tyeni na bamunata ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Banata zimbangi zi luvunu zi ta ti: «Muntu bewuwu wuna tatamana mu safula kibuka ki longo na Misiku. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Tu muyudingi wuna ta ti Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti waamwangisa kibuka bekyokyo na waakitula Misiku mi tuhaana Mose.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Bamvimba baba mu nzo yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo basungimina Tyeni na bayena kini kyandi kikituka bonso ki mbazi yi Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kinzonzi ki Tyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mfumu Nganga-Nzambi wumufuula ti: «Misamu mii bana ta mu ngeye, mi kedika midi e?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Tyeni wuvutula ti: «Yeno mpangi zani na matata mani, yuweeno! Nzambi yi nkembo wuyenikina nkaka eto Abalahami buna wakidi ku kizunga ki Mezopotami, tekila kenda ka zakala ku mbanza yi Haalani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Wumuteela ti: “Sisa nsi aku na kanda dyaku na yenda ku nsi yi naakulonka”. <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Abalahami wusisa nsi yi bisi-Kaladeya na wuyenda zakala ku mbanza yi Haalani. Ku manima ma lufwa lu tata andi, Nzambi wumutwala ku nsi beyiyi yi luzakadi bwabu. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Ku nsi beyoyo, Nzambi kamuhaana kani fwa dimosi ko, na kani huma he tedimina ko. Kansi wumusila nsilulu mu vwa byo na ku nkuna andi, ku manima ma lufwa lwandi, mpeleko Abalahami kabuta mwana ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Nzambi wumuteela ti: Nkuna aku ku nsi yinzenza ya kwenda zakala, mbo babakitula mindongo na mbo babanyokona mvula nkama ya. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Kansi meno bende naafundisa nsi beyoyo yi baaba mindongo. Ku manima, baasisa yo na mbo bakwiza sambila ha kibuka bekiki. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Nzambi wutunga luwawanu na Abalahami mu kidimbu kinzengosolo yi bubakala. Ni hahoho Abalahami kazengila mwana andi Isaaki bubakala mu kilumbu kinana ku manima ma mbutukulu andi. Isaaki wusadila bobo mu Yakobi, mpe Yakobi mu bifumba kumi na byole.»<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />«Kimpala ki zinkaka zeto kisa ti bayadika Yosefi mwanki ba munata bonso mundongo ku nsi yi Ngipiti. Kansi Nzambi wuba nandi kintwadi, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />wumuvuukisa mu mpasi zandi zimvimba. Nzambi wumuhaana ndwenga na wu sa ti ka ba muntu wumbote ha meso ma Falao, ntinu yi Ngipiti. Mpe wumutuula munyadi wu nsi yi Ngipiti na wu nzo andi yimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Malema makota mu nsi yimvimba yi Ngipiti na mu nsi yi Kana. Mpasi zihyoka kitezo na zinkaka zeto zibaka dyaka kima kye dya ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Bu bayuwa ti ku Ngipiti bindya bii koko, Yakobi wutambika nkumbu yintete zinkaka zeto kuuna. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Nkumbu yinzole, Yosefi wukizabikisa ku zimpangi zandi, mpe kanda dyandi dizabakana ku Falao. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Buna Yosefi wutambika bantu benda babonga tata andi Yakobi na kanda dyandi dimvimba. Baba makuminsambwadi na tanu ma bantu. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yakobi wukulumuka ku nsi yi Ngipiti. Ni kokoko kafwila na zinkaka zeto mpe. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Banata nitu zawu ku Sikemi na babatuula mu kati di ndyamu yi sumba Abalahami mu mbongo ku baala ba Hamoli, tata di Sikemi.»<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />«Ntangu ye lungisa nsilulu yisila Nzambi ku Abalahami bu yiba bela-bela mu fwana, mukangu eto wukula na wubutana ku nsi yi Ngipiti, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />natee bu yiza yaala ntinu yihiika, yi lembolo zaba Yosefi. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ntinu beyoyo yihuna mukangu eto na wufyetikisa zinkaka zeto na yisa ti banyafuna baala bawu bansombe mwanki ba fwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Mose wubutuka mu ntangu beyoyo. Wuba wubweya ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. Bamuyundula ngonda zitatu mu nzo yi tata andi. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Mu ntangu yi bamulosa, mwana wundumba wu Falao wumutota na wumuyundula bonso mwana andi wubakala. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mose wusansu mu ndwenga zimvimba zi bisi-Ngipiti na wuyiza ba muntu wululendo mu mpova na mu nsadulu zandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Mose bu kalungisa mvula makumaya wubaka lukanu mu kwe yenikina ba-Isaeli, zimpangi zandi. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Wuyena mwisi-Ngipiti wumosi wedi yenisa mpasi wumosi mu zimpangi zandi. Wumunwanina na wuhonda mwisi-Ngipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Yandi kedi banzila ti mpangi zandi mbo zibakula ti mu moko mandi Nzambi kabakuudila. Kansi babakuula wo ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Kilumbu kilanda, Mose wuyiza hambula ba-Isaeli bole bedi nwana na wusosa mu vutula kiyenge ha kati dyawu. Wubateela ti: “Yeno, mpangi na mpangi ludi! Mu dyambu di nki luna kiyenisina yeno na yeno mpasi e?” <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Kansi yondowo wedi yenisa wuhiika mpasi, wununguna Mose na wuta: “Nani wukutudidi mu ba mfumu na mumfundisi e? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Tiidi mu mponda bonso buwuhondidi mazono mwisi-Ngipiti e?” <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Mu mpova bezozo, Mose wuwoka na wuyenda zakala ku nsi yi Madyani. Baala bole kabuta koko.»<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />«Mvula makumaya zihyoka, ku nsi yinkatu bela-bela na mulandu wu Sinayi, mbazi yi Mfumu yimuyenikina mu milaka mi tiya myedi lemanga ha vunda di mwa muti. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Mose wuyituku bu kayena mbweno beyoyo. Kansi bu kedi finama mu toma tala, ndinga yi Mfumu yiyuwakana ti: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />“Meno nidi Nzambi yi Zinkaka zaku, Nzambi yi Abalahami, yi Isaaki na yi Yakobi.” Mose wedi tekita mu bunkuta na kedi bwesa lenda mu tala ko. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mfumu wumuteela ti: “Katula nsampatu zaku mu malu, mu dyambu ti kibuka ki wudi kidi kilongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Meno nyeni mpasi zi mukangu ani wuu ku nsi yi Ngipiti na nyudi biyahula byawu mpe nkulumukini mu bavuukisa. Yenda bwabu, nina kutambika ku nsi yi Ngipiti.”»<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />«Ni Mose bewowo wu banyafuna ku ba-Isaeli bu bata ti: “Naani wukutudidi mu ba mfumu na mumfundisi eto e?” Nzambi yandi katambikidi bonso mfumu na kivuukisi mu nzila yi mbazi yi Nzambi yi muyenikina ha vunda di miti dyedi lemanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Yandi wuduukisa ba-Isaeli ku nsi yi Ngipiti bu kahidika bidimbu na bimangu bingitukulu mu nsi beyoyo, ku mubu wumbwaki na ku nsi yinkatu mu mvula makumaya. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Mose kwandi dyaka mpe wuta ku ba-Isaeli ti: “Nzambi waaduukisa ha kati dyeno mumbikudi wumosi mu zimpangi zeno, waaba bonso meno.” <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Mu ntangu yi bakutakana ku nsi yinkatu, ni yandi wuba na mbazi yi Nzambi yedi mu zonzila ha yulu mulandu wu Sinayi mpe ha kimosi na zinkaka zeto. Yandi wutambula Mambu ma luzingu mu tuzabikisa mo. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Kansi zinkaka zeto zitya ko mu mutumimina. Bamubisa, mpe mu mayindu mawu, nganunu bavutuka kwawu ku Ngipiti. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Ni hahoho, bateela ku Aloni ti: “Tuhidikila zi nzambi za kwe dyati ku mutwala eto. Mu dyambu ti Mose bewowo wu tuduukisi ku nsi yi Ngipiti, tuzebi ko nkye misamu mi mubwididi.” <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, bahidika mwana ngombe wumosi. Bahaana minkayulu ku kiteki bekyokyo, na bakembila mu kyese kisalu ki moko mawu. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Kansi Nzambi wubateka manima na wubabiika basambila mbwetete (binwani bi) zi mazulu bonso bu wusonama mu buuku di mimbikudi ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“Kanda di Isaeli, nganunu ku meno</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">luhaana minkayulu mi bibulu na mi mihiika</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">mu makumaya ma mvula ku nsi yinkatu e?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Kaani, kansi lunata nzo yi kikapu yi nzambi Moloki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">na lubwetete lu nzambi eno Lefani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">nzambi yi biteki bebyobyo bi luhidika mwanki lufukimina byo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ni hahoho, naalunatina ku nsi yiyila kuhyoka nsi yi Babiloni.”»<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />«Ku nsi yinkatu, zinkaka zeto ziba na nzo yi kikapu yedi lonkanga ti Nzambi wuba nawu. Yondowo wuzonza ku Mose, wumutuma kahidika yo bonso bu kayenina kifwani. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Nzo yi kikapu beyoyo, basisa yo mu moko ma zinkaka zeto, na mu lutwadusu lu Yoswa, banata yo ku nsi zi bazika ku makanda ma bantu bemomo ma kuma Nzambi ha ntadisi awu. Nzo yi kikapu beyoyo yiba koko natee mu ntangu yi Davidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Davidi wuyangidika Nzambi na wulomba luve mu tungila Nzambi yi Yakobi nzo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kansi ni Solomo wumutungila nzo. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Mpeleko Nzambi Yihyokidi ku Zangama kazakalanga mu zinzo zitungu ku bantu ko. Bonso busamuna wo mumbikudi:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />“Yulu ni kyandu kyani ki bumfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">na butoto ni kifulu kinkwe tentikanga bitambi byani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nkye mpila nzo lutiidi mu ntungila e? Mfumu kateedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">ha nkye kibuka nalendi humina e?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Ka moko mani ko mahidika bima bebibi bimvimba e?”»<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />«Yeno bantu bamutu ngolo, mitima na makutu meno maa makangama, luu bonso zinkaka zeno, lukwe tingunanga kadi ntangu Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nkye mumbikudi zinkaka zeno balembolo kwamisa e? Bahonda yobobo basamuna nyizulu yi Muntu wu lunungu. Yandowo bwabu yeno wu luyekola na wu luhonda. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Yeno lutambula Misiku mu nzila yi zimbazi zi Nzambi, kansi luvumina myo ko.»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Tyeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Bu bayuwa mpova bezozo, mitima myawu minwa menga na batona mu mukwetisila meeno. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kansi, Tyeni wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo, wusendola meso ku yulu na wuyena nkembo yi Nzambi mpe Yesu wutelama ku kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Wuta ti: «Nina yena mazulu dizibuka na Mwana Muntu wutelama ku kooko ku lubakala lu Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Buna babulana mu ngolo mpe bakanga makutu. Ku manima, bamvimba bamubukumukina, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />bamunata ku mbazi yi mbanza na batona mu muwinda matadi. Zimbangi zituula binkutu byawu ha malu ma toko dimosi nkumbu andi Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Bu bedi muwinda matadi, Tyeni wusambila ti: «Mfumu Yesu, tambula mwela ani.» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Mboki, wufukama na wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Mfumu, balemvokila disumu bedidi.» Bu kamana zonza bobo, ni kafwa.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sawuli wusingisa bu ba honda Tyeni.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 8:1">Sawuli wuna fyetikisa dibundu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Tuka kilumbu bekyokyo, dibundu di mbanza yi Yelusalemi difyetokoso bubwingi. Bamvimba bamana mwangana mu bizunga bi Yuda na Samaliya, zintumwa kwandi zi saala. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Babakala bedi vuminanga Nzambi, bazika Tyeni mpe bamudila bubwingi.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Kansi Sawuli, yandi wusosa mu honda dibundu. Wedi kwe kotingi mu kadi nzo mu bwila bakento na babakala. Ni kedi batubanga mu boloko.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipi wusamuna Musamu Wumbote ku Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Yobobo ba bamwangisa bedi kwe yendi mu ndambu ka ndambu mu kwe samuni Musamu Wumbote. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipi wuyenda ku mbanza yi Samaliya, wusamuna Klisto koko. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Mpumbu yi bantu yiba yikwikama mu misamu myedi zonza Filipi, bu yiyuwa na bu yiyena bimangu bibingi bi kedi sa. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mpeve zimbi zedi duuka mu zimbevo zizingi buna zina kwe bulani. Mpe bantu babingi baba na binama bifwa (mbolokoto) na baba na byeta banyaka. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Kyese kifuluka ha kati di mbanza beyoyo.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Tuka ntama, ha kati di mbanza beyoyo, kuba na bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Simoni, bunganga kedi sadilanga na wedi sanga ti bisi-Samaliya bayituku, mpe wedi kilonkanga ti muntu wumfunu kadi. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Bamvimba, kutonina ku mwana wufyoti natee ku muntu wukula, bedi toma muyuwilanga na bedi tanga ti: «Bakala bedidi, ni lulendo lu Nzambi, lo luba kwe tumisinanga ti: “Lulendo lulunene.”» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Bedi toma muyuwilanga mu dyambu ti tuka ntangu zizingi kedi sanga ti bayituku mu nsalulu andi yi bunganga. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kansi bu bayiza kwikila Musamu Wumbote wedi samunanga Filipi, myo mitadidi kimfumu ki Nzambi na nkumbu yi Yesu-Klisto, bakento na babakala batambula mbotokolo. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simoni, yandi mpe wukwikila, wutambula mbotokolo na kabika ko mu kwe landi Filipi. Mpe wuyituku mu bidimbu na bimangu byedi hilama.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Zintumwa zi ba ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, bu ziyuwa ti bisi-Samaliya batambudi Mambu ma Nzambi, ni babatambikila Petelo na Yoane. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Bu batuula, babasambidila mwanki batambula Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Mu dyambu ti, Mpeve Yilongo buna yakulumukini ku kani wumosi mu yawu ko. Mbotokolo kaka batambula mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Petelo na Yoane babatentika moko na batambula Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simoni bu kayena ti bantu batambula Mpeve Yilongo mu ntentokolo yi moko ma zintumwa, wusosa mu bahaana mbongo, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />na wubateela ti: «Mpaaneeno meno mpe lulendo belulu, mwanki ku yondowo wu naatentika moko, katambula Mpeve Yilongo.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Kansi Petelo wumuteela ti: «Bika ti mbongo zaku zihombila ha kimosi naku, mu dyambu ti ngeye benzi ti mu mbongo lendi sumbila munkayulu wu Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ngeye wuu nakani kikunku mpe nakani ndambu difwa ko mu misamu mina hyoka ehaha, mu dyambu ti mutima aku wuu wudedama ha ntadisi yi Nzambi ko. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Vilula madyela mu mabanza maku mambi na sambila Mfumu, mwanki, kampe nanga, Nzambi lenda kulemvokila makani mambi ma mutima aku. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Mu dyambu ti nyeni ti wufuluka wudi mu musoki na wuu wukangama mu kinkole ki masumu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simoni wuvutula ti: «Sambileno yeno bende Mfumu mu dyambu dyani, mwanki na lembolo bwilulu musamu mu myo mi luteedi.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Bu bamana ta kimbangi mu Yesu-Klisto mpe mu samuna Mambu ma Mfumu, Petelo na Yoane bavutuka ku Yelusalemi. Bu bedi kwe vutuki, bedi kwe samuni Musamu Wumbote mu mabwala mamingi ma kizunga ki Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filipi na mwisi-Etyopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Mbazi yi Nzambi yiteela Filipi ti: «Telama na yendisa ku ndambusu yi sude mu nzila yikwe kulumuka kutonina mbanza yi Yelusalemi natee ku mbanza yi Ngaza. Nzila beyoyo yikwe lembolo hyokilanga dyaka bantu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Filipi wutumbu telama na wuyenda. Mu nzila, wuyena bakala dimosi di ba kitula kisita, mwisi-Etyopi, mfumu yiyinene yi Kandase, ntinu yi mukento yi nsi yi Etyopi, mpe yandi kwe kebanga bimvwama byandi, wuyiza ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu sambila. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Bu kedi kwe vutuki ku nsi andi, wuba wuzakala ha yulu kaalu, buna wuna kwe tangi buuku di mumbikudi Yesaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Mpeve wuteela Filipi ti: «Yenda mpe finama ha kaalu bedyodyo.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipi wuyenda mu ntiinu na wuyuwa mwisi-Etyopi wedi tanga buuku di mumbikudi Yesaya. Wumufuula ti: «Nga wuna bakula myo mi wuna tanga e?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Wuvutula ti: «Bwedi ndendi bakudila myo tala ti ku nani muntu wa mbangudila myo e?» Ni kalomba ku Filipi kaalu na kazakala ha ndambusu andi. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Kibuku ki Mambu ma Nzambi ki kedi tanga kita ebu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«Wuba bonso dimeme di bana nata mu kwe honda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">bonso Mwana Dimeme, wuna lembolo lokana ha ntadisi yi yondowo wuna mukatula mika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">kazibula munwa ko.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Bamufwisa nsoni na babisa mu munungisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">nani lenda zonzila mu nkuna andi e?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Mu dyambu ti bilumbu byandi ha luse lu butoto byabazengidi.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Mwisi-Etyopi wufuula Filipi ti: «Mulemvo aku, nteeleti, mumbikudi nani kana zonzila bobo e? Mu yandi bende hoti mu muntu wuhiika e?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Filipi wuzibula munwa na wutona mu musamunina Musamu Wumbote wu Yesu mu bibuku bi Mambu ma Nzambi bemomo. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Bu batatamana nzila awu, batuula ha kizinga ki mamba. Mwisi-Etyopi ni kata ti: «Mamba ema. Nki bina nkakidila mu botoko e?» [<verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipi wuta ti: «Tala ti kwikidi mu mutima aku wumvimba, lenda botoko.» Mwisi-Etyopi wuvutula ti: «Nkwikidi ti Yesu-Klisto wuu Mwana Nzambi.»] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Wuhaana lutumu mwanki kaalu dyandi di sikama. Filipi na mwisi-Etyopi bakulumuka ya babole mu mamba, mboki Filipi wubotika mwisi-Etyopi. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Bu batomboka mu mamba, Mpeve yi Nzambi yinata Filipi na mwisi-Etyopi kedi bwesa muyena ko. Ni katatamana nzila andi mu kyese. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipi wuvutuka ku mbanza yi Azoti, mboki wuyenda natee ku mbanza yi Sezale buna wuna kwe samuni Musamu Wumbote mu kadi mbanza zi kedi kwe hyokidi.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Sawuli wuviluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, Sawuli mabanza maba nandi kaka ni mu fyetikisa na mu honda milongoki mi Mfumu. Wuyenda yenikina mfumu nganga-Nzambi, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />mu mulomba mikanda mya muhaana luve mu kwe koti mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo zii ku mbanza yi Damasi. Tala ti wenzi batikisa bantu, bakento hoti babakala bana landa nzila yi Mfumu, ka bakanga na ka banata ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Bu kaba mu nzila, bela-bela na mbanza yi Damasi, wuyitukulu kwandi ni kya kikingi kifuma ku yulu, kitumbu muzungidila mu kyezezi andi. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Wubwa ha nsi na wuyuwa ndinga yedi muteela ti: «Sawuli, Sawuli, bila nki wuna mfyetikisila e?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Wumufuula ti: «Mfumu, ngeye ni nani e?» Ndinga yimuvutudila ti: «Meno ni Yesu yondowo wu wuna fyetikisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Kansi telama, kota mu mbanza. Mbo bakuteela nki fweti sa.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bantu bazyeta ha kimosi nandi batelama, mu kinkunku bekyokyo bakituka bonso mababa. Bayuwa ndinga, kansi bayena muntu ko. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sawuli wutelama. Mpeleko meso mandi maba matemoka, kansi kedi bwesa yena ko. Bamusimba mu kooko mu munata ku mbanza yi Damasi. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Bilumbu bitatu kasa, ka muyena ko, ka kudya ko mpe ka kunwa ko.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Ku mbanza yi Damasi kuba na mulongoki wumosi nkumbu andi Ananiase. Mfumu wumuyenikina mu mbweno na wumuteela ti: «Ananiase!» Wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, meno ewu!» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mfumu ni kamuteela ti: «Telama, yenda mu bala-bala yi bakwe tumisinanga ti Yisungama, mu nzo yi Yuda, fuula muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Sawuli mwisi-Talisi. Mu ntangu beyiyi, kusambila kana sa <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />mpe mu kati di mbweno, yeni muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Ananiase wuna kota na wuna mutentika moko mwanki kabwesa yena.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiase wuvutula ti: «Mfumu, bantu babingi banzonzidi muntu bewowo. Bantedidi misamu mimvimba mimbi mi kahidikidi ku balongo baku ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Wizidi ehaha na lulendo lumvimba lu katambudi ku zimfumu zi nganga-Nzambi mu bwila bamvimba bebobo bakwe sambilanga nkumbu aku.» <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kansi Mfumu wumuteela ti: «Yenda, mu dyambu ti yandi nsoodidi mpe naamusadila mu zabikisa nkumbu ani ku balembolo ba Bayudayo, ku zintinu na ku ba-Isaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Meno bende mbo na mulonka mimvimba mi kayenina mpasi mu dyambu di nkumbu ani.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananiase ni kayenda. Bu kakota mu nzo, wutentika Sawuli moko na wuta ti: «Sawuli mpangi ani, Mfumu wu kuyenikini mu nzila yi wuyizidi, yandi wuntambikidi mwanki meso maku mabwesa yena na wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Hansi na nsi, bima biba bonso makalu bi katuka mu meso. Ni kabwesa yena dyaka. Wutelama na wubotoko. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Bu kamana dya, wubaka dyaka makindangolo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="ACT 9:19">Sawuli wuna longa ku mbanza yi Damasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Wuzakala mwa bilumbu na milongoki mi ba ku mbanza yi Damasi.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Mboki, wutumbu tona mu samuna mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo ti Yesu Mwana wu Nzambi kadi. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Bamvimba bedi muyuwa, bayituku na bata ti: «Ka yandi ko wedi fyetikisanga mu ngolo zimvimba ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi yobobo bakwe sambilanga nkumbu yi Yesu e? Nga kizidi ekuku ko mu bakanga na mu banata ha ntadisi yi zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi e?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Kansi Sawuli wedi vula lonka ku kwikama kwandi na wedi kangisa Bayudayo ba mbanza yi Damasi minwa, bu kedi samuna ti Yesu Mesiya kadi.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Mwa ntangu yifyoti yihyoka, Bayudayo basa mfundu mu hondoso Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Mpimpa na mwini bedi kenganga myelo mi mbanza mwanki ba muhonda, kansi wubakula mfundu awu. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Ni hahoho, mu mpimpa milongoki mi Sawuli mimunata mu muhyokisa ku ndambusu yihiika yi kibaka ki mbanza. Mu kati di kitunga bamukulumunina.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sawuli mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Bu katuula ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, Sawuli wutonta mu ba kintwadi na milongoki. Kansi bamvimba bamuyena bunkuta mu dyambu ti bakwikila ko ti wuhikidi mulongoki. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Buna Banabase wumubonga na wumunata ku zintumwa. Wubayadila bwedi Sawuli kayenina Mfumu wu muzonzila mu nzila, mpe bwedi ku mbanza yi Damasi kasamunina mu kivuvu kimvimba nkumbu yi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Tuka ntangu beyoyo, Sawuli wuba kintwadi nawu. Wedi kwendanga na wedi vutukanga nawu mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mpe wedi longanga mu nkumbu yi Mfumu mu kivuvu kimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Mpe wedi mokananga na Bayudayo bakwe zonzanga ndinga yi kingeleke na bedi vutasananga. Kansi, yawu ni basosa mu muhondisa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bu bazaba wo, minkwikidi mimunata ku mbanza yi Sezale. Ku manima, ni bamufidisa ku mbanza yi Talisi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Dibundu dimvimba mu kizunga ki Yuda, ki Ngalili na ki Samaliya diyiza ba mu kati di kiyenge. Dibundu dyedi kula mu kiminu na dyedi dyata ku nsye lutumumu lu Mfumu, mpe bantu bedi bwesamanga babingi mu lusadusu lu Mpeve Yilongo.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ku mbanza Lida: Lunyakusu lu Ene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petelo wedi kwe zyeti mu nsi yimvimba, wuyenda ku balongo bedi zinganga ku mbanza yi Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Wuyenda yena koko, muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Ene, wuba wulambalala ha yulu mbuka tuka mvula nana, mu dyambu ti wuba na kimbevo ki mbolokoto. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petelo wumuteela ti: «Ene, Yesu-Klisto wukunyakisi. Telama na hidika ngeye bende mbuka aku.» Mpe wutumbu telama. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Mukangu wumvimba wu mbanza yi Lida na wu nsuku yi Saloni bu wumuyena, wuviluka mu landa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo ku mbanza yi Zope: Mfulukulu yi Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ku mbanza yi Zope, kuba na mulongoki wumosi wu mukento nkumbu andi Tabita. Mbangululu yi nkumbu beyoyo mu ndinga yi kingeleke ti Dolokase hoti zobongo. Wedi hidikanga misamu mimingi mimbote na wedi kabulanga mbongo zandi ku bamputu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Mu bilumbu bebyobyo, wuyiza baka kimbevo, ni kafwa. Bu bamana muyobisa, ni bamutuula mu kihinga ki ku yulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Milongoki mi mbanza yi Zope miyuwa ti Petelo wuu ha mbanza yi Lida, yi ba bela-bela na mbanza yi Zope, bamutambikila babakala bole mu mubombidila ti: «Yiza nswalu ku yeto, kusandi lunzingu ko.» <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petelo wutelama na wuyenda nawu. Bu katuula, bamunata mu kihinga ki ku yulu. Mafoola mamvimba ma muzungidila buna mana dila, ni bedi mulonka mazwele na biyunga byedi tunganga Tabita buna wakidi nawu kintwadi. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petelo wuduukisa bamvimba ku mbazi, wufukama na wusambila. Mboki, wutala ku bela mvumbi, ni kata ti: «Tabita, telama!» Wuzibula meso mpe bu kayena Petelo, ni kazakala. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petelo wumusimba mu kooko na wumutedimisa. Ku manima, wutumisa mafoola na bantu balongo. Ni kabalonka Tabita wumoyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Musamu wuzabakana mu mbanza yimvimba yi Zope na babingi bakwikila mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petelo wuzakala mwa bilumbu bifwana ha mbanza yi Zope, ku muntu wumosi wedi hidikanga bima mu mikanda mi bibulu, nkumbu andi Simoni.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mbweno yi Koneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Ku mbanza yi Sezale, kuba na bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Koneye. Wuba mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama mu kabu di bakwe tumisinanga ti: «Italike». <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Wuba munsambidi, mpe yandi na kanda dyandi dimvimba bedi yenanga Nzambi bunkuta. Wedi sadisanga bubwingi bantu na wedi tatamananga mu sambila Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Kampe kiba kilokola kitatu ku manima ma ntangu ambata, wuyena mu mbweno mbazi yi mosi yi Nzambi yedi kota ku nzo andi na yimuteela ti: «Koneye!» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Wusungimina mbazi yi Nzambi, mpe na kintekoto kimvimba, wuvutula ti: «Nki kwandi, Mfumu e?» Mbazi yi Nzambi yimuteela ti: «Nsambulu zaku na mambote ma wuhidikidi matudidi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi na wubambukidi myo moyo. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Bwabu tambika bantu ku mbanza yi Zope na benda bateela Simoni kiza, yondowo wu bakwe tumisinanga dyaka ti Petelo, <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />wuna zakalanga ku nzo yi muntu wumosi nkumbu andi mpe Simoni ha bela-bela na mubu, wedi hidikanga bima mu mikanda mi bibulu.» <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Mbazi yi Nzambi yi muzonzila, bu yi tumbu zimbala, Koneye wutumisa bantu bole mu bisadi bi nzo andi mpe mbulu-mbulu yimosi yii ku nsye lutumu lwandi, yi kwe toma sambilanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Wubayadila mimvimba mihyoka na wubatambika ku mbanza yi Zope.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Kilumbu kilanda buna bakidi mu nzila, baba bela-bela na mbanza yi Zope, Petelo wuyenda sambila ku tanda di ku yulu nzo, mu ntangu ambata. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Wubaka nsatu na wusoosa mu dya. Mu ntangu yi bedi mulambila bindya, wukota mu mpeve. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Wuyena yulu dizibuka na kima kimosi kifwanakana bonso mulele wuwunene wukangu mu makonzi maya kyedi kulumuka ha butoto. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mu kati di mulele bewowo, kuba na bibulu bimvimba bi mumpila-mumpila, bi na malu maya, byo bikwe kwe syelomokingi ha butoto na zinuni zi yulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Ndinga yimosi yimuteela ti: «Petelo telama, honda na dya!» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Kansi Petelo wuvutula ti: «Kaani Mfumu, mu dyambu ti nadidi bima bi bakanikina na bi sumuka ko.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ndinga yi bwesa muteela dyaka mu nkumbu yinzole ti: «Bima bi bikidi Nzambi bivedila, ngeye kubikandi byo bisumuka ko!» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Nkumbu zitatu kisa bobo. Ku manima, kima kitumbu tombolo ku yulu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petelo bu kaba ku nsye mayindu, wusosa mu zaba mbangululu yi mbweno yi kasa. Mpe mu ntangu beyoyo, bantu batambika Koneye, bedi kwe sosi nzo yi Simoni, bayiza tula ha mwelo wu nkotolo yi lupangu. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Batumisa na bafuula mu zaba tala ti Simoni, wuba kwe tumisina dyaka ti Petelo, mu nzo beyoyo kana zakalanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Petelo bu kedi sosanga mbangululu yi mbweno, Mpeve yimuteela ti: «Bantu batatu bana kusosa. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Telama, kulumuka na yenda nawu, kusandi maketiketi ko, mu dyambu ti meno na batambikidi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petelo wukulumuka na wuteela bantu bebobo ti: «Meno ewu, yondowo wu luna sosa. Nkye musamu wu lutwedi ekuku e?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Bavutula ti: «Koneye mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, muntu wu lunungu wudi na kwe yenanga Nzambi bunkuta. Bayudayo mu nsi yimvimba bakwe muteela kimbangi kimbote. Mbazi yi Nzambi yi mulwengisi ti kakutumisa wenda ku nzo andi mwanki kayuwa misamu mi naaku mi wamuteela.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Petelo wubakotisa na wubalambikisa mu nzo. Kilumbu kilanda, Wuyenda nawu ha kimosi na mwa ndambu yi zimpangi zi mbanza yi Zope.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Kilumbu kilanda bayenda tula ku mbanza yi Sezale. Koneye wedi bakingilanga ha kimosi na kanda dyandi na nkayi zandi zi mutima zi katumisa. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Mu ntangu Petelo yi kedi kota, Koneye wuyenda mubwana, na wufukama ha malu mandi luse ha nsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kansi Petelo wumutedimisa na wuta ti: «Telama! Meno mpe muntu kwandi nidi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Bu bedi kwe zonzi, wukota mu nzo na wuyena bantu babingi bakutakana. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Wubateela ti: «Waluzebi ti mwina wudi ku Muyudayo mu ba kintwadi na nzenza hoti mu kota mu nzo andi. Kansi Nzambi ndonkidi ti ndendi biika muntu ko wuvedila hoti wulembolo ba wuvedila. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ni hahoho, nalembolo ketikisila mu kwiza bu luntumisi. Ntiidi mu zaba bwabu nkye musamu luntumisini.» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneye wuvutula ti: «Bilumbu biya bihyoka, bonso kilokola bekiki kitatu ku manima ma ntangu ambata. Kusambila nedi sa mu kati di nzo ani. Nayitukulu kwani muntu wumosi wulwata binkutu bina vekoveko, wutelama ha ntadisi ani, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ntedidi ti: “Koneye, Nzambi yudi lusambulu lwaku na bambukidi moyo mambote ma wuhidikidi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tambika bwabu muntu ku mbanza yi Zope kenda kateela Simoni kiza, wu bakwe tumisinanga ti Petelo. Mu nzo yi Simoni, kwe hidikanga bima mu mikanda mi bibulu, kakwe zakalanga, bela-bela na mubu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Nina tumbu tambika bantu mu kwiza kusosa, mpe bumbote sidi mu kwiza. Bwabu yeto bamvimba yababa ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu yuwa mimvimba mi kutumini Mfumu mu tuteela.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinzonzi ki Petelo ku nzo yi Koneye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Petelo wuzibula munwa na wuta ti: «Kedika, bwabu mbakudi ti Nzambi kaswasikisanga bantu ko, <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />mpe mu kadi nsi, wonso wamuyena bunkuta na wasadila ludedomo, Nzambi wamuyangalala. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Wutambika mpolo ku baala ba-Isaeli: mu basamunina Musamu Wumbote wu kiyenge mu Yesu-Klisto, yandi wudi Mfumu yi makanda ma bantu bamvimba. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Yeno luzebi misamu mihyoka ku kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda, kutonina ku kizunga ki Ngalili, ku manima ma musamu wumbotokolo wusamuna Yoane. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Yeno luzebi bwedi Nzambi kadukudila Mpeve Yilongo mu Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti, mpe bwedi kamuhaanina lulendo lwe hidikila misamu mimbote na lwenyakisina bamvimba bebobo bedi kwamusu ku Nkadyampemba, mu dyambu ti Nzambi wuba nandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Mpe yeto tuu zimbangi zi misamu mimvimba mi kahidika mu nsi yi Bayudayo mpe mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Yandi bahonda mu mukoma ha kulunsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kansi Nzambi wumufulukisa mu bafwa kilumbu kitatu mpe wusa ti kayenika, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />ka ku bamvimba ko, kansi ku zimbangi bezozo Nzambi zi kasoola ntete. Yeto, tudya na tunwa ha kimosi nandi ku manima ma mfulukulu andi mu bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Yesu wututuma mu samuna ku mukangu na musingisa ti yandi Nzambi kasoola mu ba mumfundisi wu bantu bamoyo na bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Mimbikudi mimvimba mita kimbangi ti wonso muntu kwikidi mu yandi, tambudi mu nkumbu andi ndemvokolo yi masumu.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo batambudi Mpeve Yilongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petelo bu kedi zonzanga, Mpeve Yilongo yikulumuka ku yobobo bamvimba bedi yuwa kinzonzi kyandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Minkwikidi mimvimba mi Bayudayo, miyiza ha kimosi na Petelo, miyituku mu dyambu ti Mpeve Yilongo yi mwangana mu bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Mu dyambu ti, bedi bayuwa bana zonza ndinga zinzenza na bana kembila bunene bu Nzambi. Petelo ni kata ti: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />«Nga tulendi bisa mu botika mu mamba bantu bebaba batambudi Mpeve Yilongo bonso yeto e?» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ni kahaana lutumu bababotika mu nkumbu yi Yesu-Klisto. Ni bamulomba kazakala nawu mwa bilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Petelo ha ntadisi yi dibundu di Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Zintumwa na zimpangi ziba ku kizunga ki Yuda ziyuwa ti, bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo batambudi yawu mpe Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Petelo bu katomboka ku Yelusalemi, minkwikidi mi Bayudayo mimusemba. <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />Bata ti: «Bwedi ngeye wuyenzi kotila ku zinzo yi bantu balembolo zengoso bubakala bwawu na didi ha kimosi nawu!» <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ni hahoho, Petelo katonina mu bateela bwedi musamu wuhyokila. Wuta ti :<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />«Ku mbanza yi Zope naba. Mu ntangu yi nedi sambila, na kota mu mpeve, nina yena mbweno: kima kimosi kifwanakana bonso mulele wuwunene, wukangu mu makonzi maya, kifuma ku yulu na kiyiza natee ku meno. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Bu nasungimina kyo bumbote, ni nayena bibulu bi ha butoto bii na malu maya, bibulu bi musitu, byo bikwe kwe syelomokingi ha butoto na zinuni zi yulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Ku manima, nina yuwa ndinga yi nteela ti : “Petelo telama, honda na dya!” <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Kansi nina vutula ti: “Kaani Mfumu, mu dyambu ti nadidi bima bi bakanikina na bi sumuka ko.” <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Tuka ku yulu, ndinga yi bwesa yuwakana dyaka nkumbu yi nzole ti: “Bima bi bikidi Nzambi bivedila, ngeye kubikandi byo bisumuka ko!” <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Nkumbu zitatu kisa bobo. Mboki, bimvimba bitumbu tombolo ku yulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi, babakala batatu bafuma ku mbanza yi Sezale, batula ku nzo yi nedi zakidilanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Mpeve yinteela nenda nawu wulembolo sa maketiketi. Mpangi zisambanu bezizi ziyenda ha kimosi nani, zikota nani mu nzo yi Koneye. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Yandi wutuyadila bwedi mbazi yi Nzambi yi muyenikina mu kati di nzo andi na yi muteela ti: “Tambika muntu ku mbanza yi Zope mwanki kenda kateela Simoni kiza, yondowo wu bakwe tumisinanga dyaka ti Petelo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Mpolo zi kaaluyadila zaaluvuukisa, ngeye na kanda dyaku dimvimba.” <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Bu natona mu zonza, Mpeve Yilongo yi kulumuka ku yawu bonso bu yikulumuka ku yeto ku ntonono. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Mboki nina bambuka moyo ndinga yi Mfumu yita ti: “Yoane wubotika mu mamba, kansi yeno mu Mpeve Yilongo balubotikila.” <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Tala ti Nzambi wubaheeni munkayulu wumosi bonso wukatuhaana yeto bu tukwikila mu Mfumu Yesu-Klisto, buna meno nani nidi mu kakidila Nzambi e?» <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Bu bamana yuwa misamu bemyomyo, bantu badingama na batona mu kembila Nzambi, mpe bata ti: «Nzambi heeni bwabu ku balembolo ba Bayudayo hwahwa dye vilula madyela, mwanki ba baka luzingu lukedika.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntonono yi dibundu di Antiose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Yobobo bamana mwangana mu dyambu di Mfyetokoso zibwa ku manima ma lufwa lu Tyeni, bayenda natee ku kizunga ki Fenisi, ku Sipeli na ku mbanza yi Antiose. Kansi ku Bayudayo kaka basamuna Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Bantu bahiika ha kati dyawu baba bisi-Sipeli na bisi-Sileni, bu batuula ku mbanza yi Antiose, basamuna Musamu Wumbote wu Mfumu Yesu ku Bayudayo bakwe zonzanga ndinga yi kingeleke. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Lulendo lu Mfumu luba mu yawu, mu dyambu ti bantu babingi bakwikila na bahaana luzingu lwawu ku Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Dibundu di Yelusalemi bu diyuwa musamu bewowo, ditambika Banabase ku mbanza yi Antiose. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Bu katuula koko, wuyena bwedi Nzambi ka basakumunina. Wuyangalala na wubasyamisa bamvimba batatama mu ba bakwikama mu Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Banabase wuba muntu wumbote, wufuluka mu kiminu na mu Mpeve Yilongo. Mpumbu yiyinene yi bantu bakwikila mu Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Banabase wuyenda bwabu ku mbanza yi Talisi mu kwe bonga Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Bu kamuyena, wumunata ku mbanza yi Antiose. Bahyokisa ya babole mvula yimvimba mu dibundu bedyodyo, na bedi longanga bantu babingi. Ni ku mbanza yi Antiose batumisina milongoki mu nkumbu yintete ti: ba-Klisto.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusadusu ku zimpangi zii ku kizunga ki Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mimbikudi mituuka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mpe mikulumuka ku mbanza yi Antiose. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Wumosi mu ya babole nkumbu andi Angabusi, wutelama na wubikula mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo ti nsatu yiyinene yaabwa mu nza yimvimba. Nsatu mpe ni yibwa mu ntangu yi ntinu Kolode. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Ni hahoho, milongoki mibongila zengolo mu tambika lusadusu ku zimpangi zikwe zinganga ku kizunga ki Yuda. Bonso budi mbakulu yi kadi muntu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ni basadila bobo. Batambika lo ku bakuluntu mu moko ma Banabase na Sawuli.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Zaki mpe Petelo mu boloko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, ntinu Elode wutona mu kwamisa binama bihiika bi dibundu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Wuhonda mu mbele yi mvita Zaki, mpangi yi Yoane. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Bu kayena ti musamu bewowo wuyangidika Bayudayo, ni kakangusu Petelo mu ntangu yi mukembo wu mampa ma kiputi kilembolo vimba. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Bu kamukangusu na bu kamutuba mu boloko, wulomba ku makabu maya mana zimbulu-mbulu ziya mu kadi kabu mu mukenganga. Wuba na mayindu me mu fundisa ha meso ma mukangu ku manima ma mukembo wu Pake. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Petelo bu kaba mu boloko, dibundu ditatamana mu sambila Nzambi mu dyambu dyandi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbazi yikuula Petelo mu boloko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Mpimpa yi tekila kilumbu Elode ki kaketi mufundisa, Petelo wubwa tolo ha kati di zimbulu-mbulu zole, wuba wubinduku mu misinga myole mi bisengo, mpe minkengi miba ha mwelo wu boloko. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Mbazi yimosi yi Mfumu yitumbu yenika, mpe kukya kulezima mu kihinga. Mbazi yisungika Petelo, yimusimba mu lubanzi. Yimuteela ti: «Telama munswalu!» Misinga mi bisengo mi ba nandi mu moko minyanguka. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Mboki mbazi yi yimuteela ti: «Lwata melika na nsampatu zaku.» Ni kasa bobo. Mbazi yi muteela dyaka ti: «Lwata kiyunga kyaku mpe ndanda.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petelo wutotoka ni kedi kwe mulandi. Kansi kazaba ko ti misamu myedi hidika Mbazi mi ba mi kedika: wubanzila ti mbweno kabeki. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Bahyoka minkengi mintete, mboki minzole, ni batuula ha mwelo wu kisengo wutadisa ku mbanza. Mwelo bu wuzibuka wabende ha ntadisi awu, ni baduuka. Bedi kwe yendi mu bala-bala yimosi, mboki Mbazi yitumbu sisa Petelo.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Kimuntu bu kimuvutuka, Petelo wuta ti: «Bwabu mbakudi ti Mfumu ntambikidi Mbazi andi mu nkuula mu moko ma Elode na mimvimba mimbi myedi saka mpidikila mukangu wu Bayudayo.»<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Bu kabakula, wuyenda ku nzo yi Maliya ngudi yi Yoane, wuba kwe tumisina dyaka ti Malako. Bantu babingi bakutakana kooko na bedi sambila. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petelo bu kakonkota ha mwelo wu nkotolo yi lupangu, kisadi kimosi ki mukento nkumbu andi Lode, wuyiza ha mwelo mu yuwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Wubakula ndinga yi Petelo. Mu kyese bekyokyo, kazibula mwelo ko, wuyenda kota mu ntiinu mu nzo, mu kwe ta ti Petelo wuu wutelama ha mwelo. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Bamutuka ti: «Ngeye wulahuka wudi!» Kansi yandi wutatamana mu ta ti wukedika wudi. Ni bata bwabu ti: «Buna Mbazi andi yidi.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Petelo wutatamana mu konkota. Bu bazibula, bayituku mu muyena. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Wubalabikisa mwanki babika mu sa lusuku na wubayadila bwedi Mfumu kamuduukisila mu boloko. wubwesa ta ti: «Yendeeno luta wo ku Zaki na ku zimpangi zani zihiika.» Mboki, wuduuka na wuyenda ha kibuka kihiika. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Bwisi bu bukya, mvwanzi yiyinene yikota ha kati yi zimbulu-mbulu. Zikifuula yawu na yawu mu zaba Petelo nki kabweni. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Elode wulomba bamusosa, kansi bamuyena ko. Wuvwika minkengi byuhu na wutuma babanata. Mboki, Petelo wusisa kizunga ki Yuda na wukulumuka ku mbanza yi Sezale mu zakala mwa bilumbu koko.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lufwa lu Elode Angilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Elode wuba na mankesi mangolo mu bantu ba mbanza yi Tile na Sidoni. Yawu ni bayuwasana mu kwe muyenikina. Bu bamana yeba Balasituse, mfumu yi nzo yi ntinu, ni balomba kiyenge mu dyambu ti mu kizunga ki ntinu bedi bakilanga bindya mu bizunga byawu. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Mu kilumbu ki basoola, Elode wulwata kinkutu kyandi ki kintinu. Wuzakala ha kyandu kyandi ki kintinu na wusa kinzonzi kikinene ha meso ma bantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Mukangu wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Yo ndinga yi nzambi yidi, kansi ka yi muntu wumpamba ko!» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Hansi na nsi Mbazi yimosi yi Mfumu yi tumbu mukata, mu dyambu ti kakembisa Nzambi ko. Mpe, misyete mimana mudya, ni kafwa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Mambu ma Nzambi matatamana mu mwangana bubwingi. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Banabase na Sawuli bu bamanisa kisalu kyawu ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, Bavutuka na banata ha kimosi nawu Yoane, yondowo wuba kwe tumisinanga dyaka ti Malako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nzyetolo yi kisalu yi Banabase na Sawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mu dibundu di ku mbanza yi Antiose, muba na mimbikudi mpe na milongisi: Banabase, Simeoni wuba kwe tumisina dyaka ti Ndombe, Lusyuse mwisi-Sileni, Manane wuba nkayi yi bulezi yi Elode, yondowo wedi yaalanga kizunga ki Ngalili na Sawuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Kilumbu kimosi, bu bedi sambilanga Nzambi na kumina nsoki, Mpeve Yilongo yibateela ti: «Tuleno Banabase na Sawuli ha luhengo mu dyambu di kisalu ki nabatumisini.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Ni hahoho, bu bamana sambila na kumina nsoki, ni babatentika moko na bababika benda.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Banabase na Sawuli ku mbanza yi Sipeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Mu lutumu lu Mpeve Yilongo wubafidisa, Banabase na Sawuli bakulumuka ku mbanza Selesi ku bakotila mu masuwa mu kwenda ku mbanza yi Sipeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Bu batuula ha mbanza yi Salamine, basamuna Mambu ma Nzambi mu zinzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo. Yoane-Malako wuba nawu mu kwe babakisi. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bu bamana sabuka kizanga natee ku mbanza yi Pafosi, bayena koko nganga yimosi, nkumbu andi Bali-Yesu, wuba Muyudayo. Wedi kitumpidikanga ti yandi ni mumbikudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Bali-Yesu wuba mu kati di yobobo bedi salanga kintwadi na Munyadi Selengiyusi Pawulusi, muntu wu madyela. Wulomba batumisa Banabase na Sawuli, mu dyambu ti wutya mu yuwa Mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kansi nganga Elimasi, bonso buu mbangululu yi nkumbu andi, wedi bakanga nzila mu sosa mu zezisa kiminu ki Munyadi. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Ni hahoho, Sawuli wuba kwe tumisinanga mpe ti Pawuli, wufuluka mu Mpeve Yilongo, wusungimina bumbote Elimase na wuta ti: <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />«Mwana Satana wudi, ngeye muntu wufuluka mu luvunu na mbalu, mpe wukwe lembolo tyanga lunungu. Nga waabika ko mu tengimisa nzila zisungama zi Mfumu e? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Tala bwabu kooko ku Mfumu ku lambukidi mu ngeye: mpofo waaba na mwa bilumbu bifwana waayena dyaka mwini ko. Hansi na nsi, meso ma Elimase mazibama na wukota mu tombe.» Mpe wudyengila ndambu ka ndambu mu sosa muntu wulenda musimba mu kooko mu kwe munati. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Bu kayena misamu bemyomyo mihyoka, Munyadi wukwikila na wuyituku mu ndongosolo yi Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Balanabase ku mbanza yi Antiose yi Pisidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pawuli na zinkayi zandi bakota mu masuwa ha mbanza yi Pafosi na bayenda ku mbanza yi Pelezi mu kizunga ki Pamfili. Kansi Yoane-Malako wukabuka nawu hoho na wuvutuka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Balandila nzila awu ku tonina ku mbanza yi Pelezi natee bu batuula ku mbanza yi Antiose yi Pisidi. Kilumbu ki saba, bakota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo na bazakala. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Bu bamana tanga mii mu Misiku na mu mimbikudi, zimfumu zi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo babateela ti: «Yeno zimpangi, tala ti mwa dyambu dye syamisina mukangu di neeno, zonzeeno bwabu!» <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pawuli wutelama, wubalabikisa mu kooko na wuta ti: «Ba-Isaeli, yeno luna bunkuta bu Nzambi, yuweeno! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Nzambi yi Isaeli, mukangu eto, wusoola zinkaka zeto. Wunyekisa mukangu bewuwu ku nsi yi Ngipiti ku wuba, na wuduukisa wo mu koko kwandi ku lulendo. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Bavividila kampe mvula makumaya ku nsi yinkatu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Bu kamana honda bantu ba zinsi nsambwadi mu kizunga ki Kana, ni kabahaana butoto bwawu bonso fwa, <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />mu zimvula nkama ya na makumatanu. Mboki ku manima, wubatambika mimfundisi natee mu ntangu yi mumbikudi Samueli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Mboki balomba ntinu, Nzambi ni kabahaana Sawuli, mwana wu Kise mu kanda di Benyami, wuyaala makumaya ma mvula. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Nzambi bu kakatula Sawuli, wubahaana Davidi bonso ntinu. Ni kamuteela kimbangi ti: “Nsodidi Davidi, mwana wu Yese, bakala di yangikidi mutima ani. Yandi waalungisa luzolo lwani lumvimba.” <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Mu nkuna yi Davidi, bonso bu kasila nsilulu andi, Nzambi kasoodila Yesu Muvuukisi yi Isaeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Tekila nyizulu andi, Yoane wusamuna ku mukangu wumvimba wu Isaeli mbotokolo yi mvilukulu yi madyela. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Yoane mpe bu katuula ku nsukunu yi kisalu kyandi, wuta ti: “Yeno nani luna banzila nidi e? Meno nii yandi ko! Kansi yondowo wuna kwiza ku manima mani, nidi wulunga ko mu munyanguna misinga mi nsampatu zandi.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«Mpangi zani, yeno luu baala mu nkuna yi Abalahami na yeno lukwe banga na bunkuta mu Nzambi, mambu bemama ma mpulusu, ku yeto mafidusu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Mu dyambu ti, bisi-Yelusalemi na mfumu zawu babakula ko Yesu nani kaba. Mpe babakula ko misamu mi mimbikudi mi bakwe tanga kadi saba, kansi bu bamuzengila lufwa, balungisa myo. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Mpeleko bamubakila kibila kye mu zengila lufwa ko, kansi balomba ku Pilatu kamuhondoso. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Bu balungisa mimvimba misonama mu nkumbu andi, bamukulumuna ha kulunsi na bamutuula mu ndyamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kansi Nzambi wumufulukisa mu bafwa. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Wuyenika bilumbu bibingi ku yobobo bedi kwe zyeti nandi, kutonina ku kizunga ki Ngalili natee ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Yawu beka bwabu zimbangi zandi ha ntadisi yi mukangu. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Yeto mpe, tulusamunini Musamu bewuwu Wumbote: nsilulu yi basa ku zinkaka zeto, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Nzambi wutoma lungisa yo ku yeto baala bawu, bu kafulukisa Yesu mu bafwa, bonso bu wusonama mu mukunga wunzole ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">“Ngeye Mwana ani wudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">Bubedidi neka Tata aku.”<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Wumufulukisa mu bafwa mwanki ka lembolo bola. Bwabobo kateela ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">Mbo naluhaana bima bilongo bi Davidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">byo bi na mu siila nsilulu.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ni hahoho kabwesa ta dyaka mu kibuku kihiika ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">“Waabika ko ti nitu yi kisadi kyaku kilongo yibodila mu ndyamu.”<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Davidi, bu kamanisa mu sadila, mu ntangu andi, luzolo lu Nzambi, wufwa. Bamuzika ha bazikila zi zinkaka zandi na wubola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kansi yondowo Nzambi wukafulukisa mu bafwa, kabola ko. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Mpangi zani, zabeeno wo ti: mu dyambu dyandi balusamunina ndemvokolo yi masumu, na luyiza ba bantu ba lunungu ko mu dyambu di Misiku mi Mose. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Mu dyambu dyandi mpe, wonso muntu waakwikila mu yandi, waaba muntu wu lunungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Kebeno kweno mwanki misonika mimbikudi mi lembolo lutudila:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“Taleno, yeno mintinguni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Beno bayituku na zimbaleeno!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Mu dyambu ti meno mbo nasala mu ntangu eno dyambu dyaasa ti lulembolo kwikila tala ti muntu wuluyadidi wo.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Bu baduuka mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, bababombidila bavutuka mu saba dina kwiza, mwanki babwesa zonzila musamu bewowo kwandi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Lukutukunu bu lumwangana, Bayudayo babingi na banzenza bakota mu dibundu di Bayudayo, balanda Pawuli na Banabase. Bu bedi mokananga nawu, ni bedi basyamisa baba bakwikama mu mulemvo wu Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Saba dilanda, fisala kwa nga bantu bamvimba ba mbanza bakutakana mu yuwa Mambu ma Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Bayudayo bu bayena mpumbu beyoyo yi bantu, mitima myawu mifuluka mu musoki. Ni bedi bangisa Pawuli na kutuka. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Pawuli na Banabase babateela mu kedika kimvimba ti: «Nga ku yeno Mambu ma Nzambi mafwanakana ntete mu samuna. Kansi bu lulosidi mo na bu lubisidi mu tambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, yeto twenzi kweto bwabu ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Mu dyambu ti Mfumu wutuheeni ntumunu eyi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“Nakusodidi mu ba mwinda ku bantu ba zinsi zihiika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">Mwanki wunata mpulusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">Natee ku sukina butoto.”»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Balembolo ba Bayudayo bayangalala bu bayuwa bobo, bakembila Mambu ma Mfumu, na yobobo bamvimba basoolo mu tambula luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu, bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mambu ma Mfumu mamwangana mu nsi yimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kansi Bayudayo basindisila bakento bazangama na bakwe toma sambilanga Nzambi mpe bakuluntu ba mbanza banangumuka. Basosila Pawuli na Banabase mfyetokoso, ni babakuma mu kizunga kyawu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Yawu bu babakubudila fundu-fundu di bitambi byawu, ni bayenda ku mbanza yi Ikonyomi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Milongoki, yawu miba mifuluka mu kyese na mu Mpeve Yilongo.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Banabase ku mbanza yi Ikonyomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Ku mbanza yi Ikonyomi, Pawuli na Banabase bayenda kota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo mpe balonga Mambu ma Nzambi ma sa ti Bayudayo babingi na Bangeleke bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kansi Bayudayo babisa mu kwikila, basindisila yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo mwanki banangumukina zimpangi zawu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Pawuli na Banabase bazingila ku mbanza yi Ikonyomi. Bedi longanga mu kivuvu kimvimba misamu mitadidi Mfumu. Mfumu wedi bahaananga lulendo mu hidika bidimbu na bimangu mu lonka kikedika ki kimbangi ki bedi kwe samuni. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Nkabani yikota ha kati di mukangu mu mbanza: kuba na bantu baba ku sambu di Bayudayo, bahiika ku sambu di zintumwa. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Balembolo ba Bayudayo na Bayudayo, ha kimosi na zimfumu zawu, bakubama mu bayenisa mpasi na mu bawinda matadi, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />bu babakula bobo, bayenda swama ku kizunga ki Likaoni, mu mbanza yi Lisiteli na yi Delebi na mu mabwala ma kizunga bekyokyo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Basamuna koko mpe Musamu Wumbote.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Banabase ku mbanza yi Lisiteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Ku mbanza yi Lisiteli, kuba na muntu wumosi wuba wedi lembolo telamanga, wuba kikata tuka mbutukulu andi na kedi kwe yenzingi ko. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Wedi yuwa Pawuli bu kedi zonza. Pawuli wumusungimina, bu kayena ti wuba na kiminu mu vuuka, <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />wumuteela mu ngolo ti: «Telama na sikama mu malu maku!» Muntu wo wudumuka na wutona mu kwe dyati. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Bu bayena myo mihiidika Pawuli, mpumbu yi bantu yi lookana mu ngolo mu ndinga yi bisi-Likawoni ti: «Zinzambi zi bongidi kifwani ki bantu zizidi ku yeto.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Bantu bedi tumisina Banabase ti «Zuse», na Pawuli ti «Elemesi», mu dyambu ti yandi wedi kwe zonzi. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Nganga-Nzambi yi Zuse wuba ha nkotolo yi mbanza, wunata zingombe zimbakala zi balwatisa bifulu ha nkotolo yi lupangu. Yandi na mpumbu yi bantu batya mu haana munkayulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Bu bayuwa bobo, Banabase na Pawuli bakyakuna binkutu byawu na banookisa ku bela mpumbu yi bantu buna bana kwe zonzi mu ngolo ti: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />«Mpangi zani, bila nki luna hidikila misamu mibububu e? Yeto mpe bantu kwandi tudi bonso yeno, na tulutwadidi Musamu Wumbote wuna lulomba mu loosa biteki bebyobyo bimpamba-mpamba, mwanki lwiza ku Nzambi yimoyo yihidika Yulu, butoto, mubu na bimvimba bimomo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Mu mbandu zihyoka, wuhaana kimpwanza ku zinsi zimvimba zilanda nzila zawu zi batiidi mu landa, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />mpeleko kabika ko mu balonka mambote mandi: wuluheeni zimvula zikwe fumanga ku yulu na mbutu zizingi mu ntangu yi nyonzokolo. Wuluheeni bindya na fulusi mitima myeno mu kyese.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Mpeleko bedi bazonzila bobo, mu mpasi balendila mu sa mpumbu yitambudila mu lembolo bahaana munkayulu.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Bayudayo bafuma ku mbanza yi Antiose na yi Ikonyomi, bayiza leba mpumbu yi bantu mwanki banangumukina Pawuli. Bawinda Pawuli matadi mu muhonda. Mboki, ni bedi kwe mukokomoni natee ku mbazi yi mbanza, mu dyambu ti babanzila ti fwidi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kansi, milongoki bu mi muzungidila, wusungama na wukota mu kati di mbanza. Kilumbu kilanda, wuyenda ha kimosi na Banabase ku mbanza yi Delebi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Banabase bavutuka ku mbanza yi Antiose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Basamuna Musamu Wumbote mu mbanza beyoyo mpe ba baka milongoki mimingi, ku manima bavutuka ku mbanza yi Lisiteli, yi Ikonyomi na yi Antiose. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Bedi kwe kindisi milongoki mu mbanza bezozo na bedi kwe balombi baba bakwikama mu kiminu, mu bateela ti: «Mu mpasi zizingi twaakotila mu kimfumu ki Nzambi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Basoola bankuluntu mu kadi dibundu, mpe bu bamana sambila na kumina nsoki, ni babayekola mu moko ma Mfumu, yondowo wu basila kiminu.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Bu bahyokila yi kizunga ki Pisidi, bayenda ku mbanza yi Pamfili, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />basamuna Mambu ma Nzambi ku mbanza yi Pelezi, mboki bakulumuka ku mbanza yi Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Ha mbanza yi Ataliya bakotila masuwa mu kwenda ku mbanza yi Antiose ku nsi yi Siliya. Ha mbanza beyoyo babayekodila mu moko ma Nzambi mu dyambu di kisalu bekyokyo ki basedi. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Bu batuula, Pawuli na Banabase bayonzika dibundu na babayadila misamu mimvimba Nzambi mi kahidika nawu, mpe bwedi kazibudila nzila ku balembolo ba Bayudayo bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Ni bahyokisa bilumbu bibingi na milongoki.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Lukutukunu lu Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu yifuma ku kizunga ki Yuda yihaana ndongosolo ku zimpangi ti: «Lulendi baka mpulusu ko tala ti luzengoso bubakala ko bonso buna tumina Misiku mi Mose.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pawuli na Banabase bavutasana na bayumana nawu. Ni hahoho, balomba ku Pawuli na Banabase, mpe ku bantu bahiika, batomboka ku Yelusalemi mu kwe yenikina zintumwa na bakuluntu mwanki bahidika musamu bewowo. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Ni hahoho, dibundu di Antiose dikubika nzyetolo awu. Bahyokila yi bizunga bi Fenisi na Samaliya mu kwe yadi mpolo yi mvilukulu yi balembolo ba Bayudayo. Yi yangidika bubwingi zimpangi zizingi. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Bu batuula ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, bababwana ku dibundu, ku zintumwa na ku bankuluntu, mpe Pawuli na Banabase babayadila misamu mimvimba Nzambi mi kahidika nawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Kansi, mwa ndambu yi bantu mu kabu di Bafalisi bayiza ba minkwikidi, ditelama na dita ti: «Bufwanakani ti bazenga bubakala bu yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo na lufweti batuma bavumina Misiku mi Mose.» <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Zintumwa na bakuluntu bakutakana mu sungimina dyambu bedyodyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Ku manima ma mvutasani yingolo, Petelo wutelama na wuta ti: «Mpangi zani, yeno luzebi ti, tuka bilumbu bintete, Nzambi wunsoola ha kati dyeno, mwanki na samuna Musamu Wumbote ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. Bayuwa wo mpe ba kwikila. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Nzambi wuzebi mitima mi bantu, wubalonka kimbangi kyandi mu bahaana Mpeve Yilongo bonso bu kasa ku yeto. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Kasa kani diswasani ko ha kati di yawu na yeto, mu dyambu ti wuvedisa mitima myawu mu kiminu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Bila nki luna tontila Nzambi, mu kwika milongoki bizitu bilembana mu nata zinkaka zeto na yeto bende mpe e? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Kansi, tukwikidi ti mu mulemvo wu Mfumu Yesu, yeto tubeki mpulusu bonso yawu mpe.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Dibundu dimvimba didingama, mpe bayuwa Banabase na Pawuli bedi yala mpolo zi bidimbu na bimangu bimvimba Nzambi bihidika mu nzila awu ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Bu bamana zonza, Zaki wuta ti: «Mpangi zani, yuweeno! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni wutuyadidi bwedi Nzambi kasila ku ntonono mu soola mukangu wu kavwidi ha kati di balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mimvimba bemyomyo myenzi detila na misamu mizonza mimbikudi, mu dyambu ti wusonama:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Ku manima, mbo navutuka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">mpe mbo nabwesa tunga nzo yi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Davidi yi mana bwonzomoka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Mbo nabwesa tunga bibaka</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">mbo natedimisa byo.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Mwanki bantu basidi, baasosa Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">bumosi mpe baa mu zinsi zimvimba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">muna samunu nkumbu ani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Mfumu teedi bo, yandi wuhidika bima bimvimba,<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />bizabakana tuka ntama.”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Ni hahoho, mbenzi ti tukwamisandi balembolo ba Bayudayo, batambudi mu sadila Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kansi, tubasonikineeno kwandi babika mu dya bibulu bi baheeni munkayulu ku biteki, mu dya bibulu bifwidi wulembolo zengo ngongodinga mpe menga, na musa kindumba. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Tuka mbandu zintama, bantu bakwe longanga Misiku mi Mose mu kadi mbanza, mboki mu kadi saba, mikwe tangungu mu nzo zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukanda wutambuku ku balembolo ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ni hahoho, zintumwa na bankuluntu bayuwasana na dibundu dimvimba mu soola ha kati dyawu Yuda wu bakwe tumisinanga ti Basabase na Silase. Babakala bole baba tomini tya ku zimpangi mwanki benda ku mbanza yi Antiose ha kimosi na Pawuli na Banabase. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Babahaana mukanda wubasonika ebu: «Yeto zintumwa, bankuluntu na zimpangi, ku yeno zimpangi zilembolo ba Bayudayo zii ku mbanza yi Antiose mu kizunga ki Siliya na ki Silisi, mbote zeno!<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tuyudi ti bantu bafumini ku yeto, bayizidi ku yeno mu kotisa mvwanzi mpe mu luzungisa mitu mu zonzolo awu. Kayeto ko tu baheeni luve. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ni hahoho, bu tuyuwasani, ni tusoodidi bantu batulutambikidi. Bana kwiza ha kimosi na mpangi zeto zi zola Banabase na Pawuli, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />yawu badi babakala bayekodi luzingu lwawu mu dyambu di nkumbu yi Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Tutambikidi Yuda na Silase, yawu baaluzabikisa mu ndinga awu misamu mi tukengi. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Buyenikini bumbote ku Mpeve Yilongo na ku yeto mu lembolo lukwika bizitu bihiika tala ti ka misamu bemimi ko mi vudidi mfunu: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />ka mu dyanga bibulu bi baheeni munkayulu ku biteki ko, na bibulu bifwidi wulembolo zengo ngongodinga mpe na menga, na ka musanga kindumba ko. Bumbote tala ti luhidikidi misamu bemimi mimvimba ko. Beeno bumbote!»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Yawu basala sisa dibundu, ni bayenda ku mbanza yi Antiose ku bakutikisa bantu mu bahaana mukanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Batanga wo, mpe bamvimba bayangalala mu syamusunu yi ba momo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yuda na Silase, bu baba yawu bende mimbikudi, bazonza misamu mimingi mu syamisa zimpangi na babakindisa mu ntangu yiyingi. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Bazakala hoho mwa ntangu yifwana, ku manima zimpangi ni zibavutula mu kiyenge ku yobobo babatambika. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Silase wuyena ti bumbote mu saala.]<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pawuli na Banabase bazakala ku mbanza yi Antiose. Hakimosi na babingi bahiika, balonga na basamuna Musamu Wumbote, Mambu ma Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Banabase bakabukidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Mwa bilumbu bihyoka, ku manima Pawuli wuta ku Banabase ti: «Tuvutuka mu kwe vunga zimpangi zii mu zimbanza zimvimba zi tube kwe samuni Mambu ma Mfumu, mu zaba bwedi bana dyatila.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Banabase wutya mu nata mpe Yoane, wu bakwe tumisinanga ti Malako, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />kansi Pawuli katya ko ba munata, mu dyambu ti, yandi wubasiisa bu baba ku mbanza yi Pamfili na kedi bwesa kwe yenzingi nawu ko mu kisalu kyawu. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Mpaka zihyokila kitezo, kadi muntu ni kayendisa ku ndambusu andi. Banabase wusoola Malako, ni bakota mu masuwa mu kwenda ku kizanga ki Sipeli. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Pawuli wusoola Silase na wuyenda. Mpangi zi mutuula ku nsye lusakumunu lu Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Bayunga mu kizunga ki Siliya na ki Silisi mu kwe kindisi Mabundu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Timote wuyenda kintwadi na Pawuli na Silase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pawuli wutuula ku mbanza yi Delebi, mboki wuyenda ku mbanza yi Lisiteli. Kuba na mulongoki wumosi, nkumbu andi Timote, ngudi andi mu Muyudayo wuyiza ba munkwikidi, kansi tata andi wuba Mungeleke. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Mpangi zi ku mbanza yi Lisiteli na yi Ikonyomi, zedi muteelanga kimbangi kimbote. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pawuli wutya mu munata. Bu kamubonga, ni kamuzengoso bubakala mu dyambu di Bayudayo baba mu bizunga bebyobyo, mu dyambu ti bamvimba bazaba ti tata andi Mungeleke wuba. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Mu zimbanza mu bedi kwe hyokidi, bedi kwe zabikisi ku zimpangi nzengolo zi bonga zintumwa na bakuluntu ba ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mpe bedi kwe balombi mu vumina zo. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Mabundu medi syama mu kiminu, mboki lutangu lu minsambidi myedi bwesamanga kadi ki kilumbu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbokolo yi mwisi-Masedwani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Pawuli na Silase bahyokila yi kizunga ki Filizi na ki Ngalatiya, mu dyambu ti Mpeve Yilongo yibakakidila mu samuna Mambu ma Nzambi mu kizunga ki Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Bu baba bela-bela na kizunga ki Misi, bakubama mu kota mu kizunga ki Bitini, kansi Mpeve yi Yesu yibakakidila. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Buna bahyokila yi kizunga ki Misi na bakulumuka ku Towasi.<verse eid="ACT 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Mu mpimpa, Pawuli wutambula mbweno yimosi: mwisi-Masedwani wumuyenikina wutelama, na wedi mubombidila ti: «Hyokila ku nsi yi Masedwani, yiza wutusadisa!» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Ku manima ma mbweno beyoyo, ni tutumbu sosa mu kwenda ku nsi yi Masedwani, mu dyambu ti tukwikila ti Nzambi wedi tutumisa koko mu kwe samuna Musamu Wumbote.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbotokolo yi Lidi ku Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Bu tukota mu masuwa ha mbanza yi Towasi, ni tutumbu kwenda ku Samotasi. Mpe kilumbu kilanda, ni tuyenda ku mbanza yi Neyapolisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Bu tukatuka hoho, ni tuyenda ku Filipi, yiba mbanza yintete yi kizunga ki Masedwani, yedi yaalanga bisi-Loma. Tuhyokisa mwa bilumbu bifwana mu mbanza beyoyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Mu kilumbu ki saba, tuduuka mu mbanza, mu kwenda ha kumu di muhwila, ku twedi banzila ti twaabaka ki bu katoma kye sambidila. Tuzakala, ni twedi zonza na bakento baba bakutakana hoho. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Wumosi mu bakento bebobo, nkumbu andi yiba Lidi, mwisi-mbanza yi Tiyatili. Wuba munkiti wu milele mimbwaki mintalu na wedi yenanga Nzambi bunkuta. Wedi tuyuwa, mpe Mfumu wumuzibula mutima mwanki ka toma yuwa misamu myedi ta Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Wubotoko ha kimosi na kanda dyandi, mboki wutubombidila, ni kata ti: «Tala ti meno wukwikama nidi mu Mfumu bonso bu luna yenina, Yizeeno lulambalala mu nzo ani.» Na wutukwikisa mu tambula.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu kati di boloko di mbanza yi Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Kilumbu kimosi, bu twedi kwenda ha kibuka ki lusambulu, kisadi kimosi ki ndumba kiyiza tubwana, kiba na mpeve yi mboma yedi musadilanga mu ta misamu myaakwiza kuntwala. Mpe mbikudulu zandi zedi vwamisanga zimfumu zandi. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Wutona mu kwe tulandi yeto na Pawuli buna wuna kwe bulani ti: «Bantu bebaba, bisadi bi Nzambi Yihyokidi Kuzangama badi, mpe yawu bana tulonka nzila yi mpulusu.» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Bilumbu bibingi kedi sanga bobo. Mfiti bu zihyokila kitezo, Pawuli wubaluka na wuta ku mpeve ti: «Na kulombidi mu nkumbu Yesu-Klisto duuka mu yandi.» Hansi na nsi, wuduuka.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Zimfumu zandi bu ziyena ti zilendi bwesa mubakila mbongo ko, ni zibwila Pawuli na Silase. Babanata ha kyanzala ha ntadisi yi mimfundisi. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Babalonka ku mimfundisi mi Loma na bata ti: «Bantu bebaba, Bayudayo badi, mvwanzi bana kotisa mu mbanza eto, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />mpe bana longa ku yeto tudi kweto bisi-Loma, kinkulu ki tulembolo ba na luve mu tambula na mu sadila.»<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Mpumbu yi bantu mpe ni yi banangumukina. Mimfundisi milomba babakatula binkutu byawu na babazuba bikoti. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Bu bamana bazuba bikoti, babakotisa mu boloko. Mpe balomba ku munkengi wu boloko katoma bakenga bumbote. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Munkengi bu katambula lutumu belolo, wubakotisa mu kihinga kii ku kati di boloko na wubatuula malu mu kikulu.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Mu kati-kati di mpimpa, Pawuli na Silase basambila na bayimbila mikunga mu kembila Nzambi. Zinkole zihiika zedi bayuwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Hansi na nsi, butoto buzakama mu nkatika ngolo na lufulu lu nzo luningana. Myelo mimvimba mi tumbu zibuka na bisengo bi bakanga zinkole zimvimba bibwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Munkengi wu boloko bu katemona na bu kayena myelo mi boloko mizibuka, wutotola mbele andi yi mvita mu lukutu na wusaka kihonda, mu dyambu ti mu mayindu mandi, zinkole zimana woka. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kansi Pawuli wulooka mu ngolo ti: «Ku kihondandi ko! Yeto bamvimba tuu kweto haha!» <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Munkengi wulomba mwinda, wukota mu muswalu mu boloko, mpe na kintekoto, wubwa ha malu ma Pawuli na Silase. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ku manima, wubaduukisa ha mbazi na wubafuula ti: «Matata mani, nki fweti sa mu baka mpulusu e?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Kwikila mu Mfumu Yesu na mbo wubaka mpulusu, ngeye na kanda dyaku.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ni basamuna mambu ma Nzambi ku yandi na ku yobobo baba mu nzo andi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Mu ntangu beyoyo kwandi yi mpimpa, munkengi wubanata na wusukula mputa zawu. Mboki, wutambula mbotokolo, yandi na bantu bandi. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Bu kabanata ku nzo andi, wubahaana bindya. Wuyangalala ha kimosi na kanda dyandi bu bakwikila mu Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Bwisi bu bukya, mimfundisi mi Loma mitambika bisadi byawu mwanki benda bateela ku munkengi wu boloko ti: «Haana bantu bebobo kimpwanza.» <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Munkengi wu boloko wutudisa mpolo ku Pawuli ti: «Mimfundisi milombidi baluyambula. Duukeeno bwabu na yendeeno mu kiyenge.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Kansi Pawuli wuta ti: «Batuzubidi bikoti ha meso ma bantu, mpe wulembolo fundusu, batukotisi mu boloko mpeleko bisi-Loma tudi, na batiidi bwabu mu tuhaana kimpwanza mu mansweki e? Bulendi ba ko. Biza yawu bende batuhaana kimpwanza!» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Bisadi biyenda yala mpolo ku mimfundisi. Mimfundisi ni miyena bunkuta bu bayuwa ti Pawuli na Silase bisi-Loma badi. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Bayiza balomba mulemvo, mpe bu babayambula, babalomba bakatuka ha mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Bu baduuka mu boloko, Pawuli na Silase bayenda ku nzo yi Lidi. Bayenikina zimpangi mu bakindisa, mboki ni bayenda.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Silase ku mbanza yi Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pawuli na Silase bahyokila yi mbanza yi Amfipolisi na yi Apoloni, batuula ku mbanza yi Tesalonika kuba na nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Bonso buba kifu kyandi, Pawuli wukota momo. Zisaba zitatu kasa mu mokananga nawu mu myo mitadidi Masonama, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />wedi bangudilanga na wedi balonkanga ti Mesiya fweti yena mpasi na fweti fuluka mu bafwa: «Kedi bateelanga ti Yesu wunina lusamunina, ni yandi wuu Mesiya.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Mwa ndambu bantu mu bedi muyuwa bakwikila na bayiza ba kintwadi na Pawuli na Silase, ha kimosi mpe na zingeleke zizingi zikwe sambilanga Nzambi na bakento babuzitu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kansi Bayudayo bafuluka mu musoki, babundana na mwa ndambu yi bimpumbulu bi babaka mu zi nzila. Banangumuka ha kati di mukangu na bakotisa mvwanzi mu mbanza. Bayenda taana nzo yi Yasoni mu kwe sosi Pawuli na Silase mwanki babanata ha ntadisi yi mukangu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Bu balembolo bayena, ni banata Yasoni na mwa ndambu yi zimpangi zihiika ha ntadisi yi zimfumu zi mbanza. Babulana ti: «Bantu bebaba bakotisa mvwanzi mu nza yimvimba, beka bwabu ehaha! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ni Yasoni wubatambudi ku nzo andi. Bantu bebaba bamvimba bana vumina Misiku mi ntinu Kayisali ko. Yawu ntinu yihiika bazebi, ni Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Misamu bemyomyo midumuna mitima mi mpumbu yi bantu na mi mfumu zi mbanza, <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />ni hahoho, tekila bayambula Yasoni na bahiika, bafweti futa ntalu yi mbongo yi babazengila.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Silase ku mbanza yi Beli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Mpimpa bu yitumbu bwa, zimpangi zitinisa Pawuli na Silase ku mbanza yi Beli. Bu batuula, bayenda kota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Yawu baba na mitima mimbote kuhyoka Bayudayo ba mbanza yi Tesalonika. Batambula mambu ma Nzambi mu nkatika vema. Mpe kadi kilumbu, bedi fyongoninanga Masonama, mu zaba tala ti mi bedi bateelanga miba mi kedika. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Bantu babingi bakwikila. Ha kati di Bangeleke bakento babuzitu na babakala babingi bakwikila.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kansi Bayudayo ba mbanza yi Tesalonika, bu bayuwa ti Pawuli wuna samuna mpe mambu ma Nzambi ku mbanza yi Beli, bayenda koko mu sa mvwanzi na mu lomba ku mpumbu yi bantu yinangumuka. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ni hahoho, zimpangi zitumbu tinisa Pawuli ku ndambusu yi mubu. Kansi Silase na Timote, basaala ha mbanza yi Beli. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Yobobo bedi kwe twadisi Pawuli, bamunata natee ku mbanza yi Ateni. Mboki, bavutuka ku mbanza yi Beli. Pawuli wulomba ku Silase na Timote, benda mu nswalu baba kintwadi nandi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ku mbanza yi Ateni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pawuli bu kedi kingilanga Silase na Timote ha mbanza yi Ateni, mutima andi wuvizuka bu kayena mbanza beyoyo yifuluka mu biteki. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ni kedi mokanga mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, na Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo bedi sambilanga Nzambi, mpe kadi kilumbu na yobobo ba kedi bwabwananga ha kyanzala. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Mwa ndambu yi bantu bandwenga, baba mu kabu di Epikuli na di Sitoyisi bayiza mokana nandi. Bahiika bedi tanga ti: «Muntu wu lusuku bewuwu, nki katiidi mu ta e?» Bu kedi samunanga Yesu na mfulukulu mu bafwa, bahiika dyaka, bata ti: «Keti yandi wuna samuna binzambi-nzambi bi zinsi zinzenza.» <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ni hahoho bamubongila na bamunatina ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki luyaalu kyedi kutakananga ku mulandu wu Alewopaze. Ni bamufuula ti: «Nga tulendi zaba nkye ndongosolo yimoona wuna zonzila e? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Mu dyambu ti misamu mi wuna tuyuwikisa minzenza midi. Bwabu tutiidi mu zabila myo mbangudulu.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Bisi-Ateni bamvimba na banzenza bedi zinganga mu mbanza beyoyo, bedi hyokisanga ntangu awu mu zonza na mu yuwa mpolo zimona.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Pawuli, wutelama ha kati di Alewopaze na wuta ti: «Yeno bantu ba mbanza yi Ateni, ni nayena ti nkatika ludi bantu bakangama mu kinzambi mu mimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Bu nzungani mu mbanza eno mpe nsungimini bumbote bifulu byeno bi lusambulu. Nayeni mpe kuku dimosi dye yokila minkayulu, dii na bisono ebi: “Ku nzambi yi lembolo zabu”. Yondowo wululembolo zaba wu lukwe sambilanga, ni yandi nina lusamunina. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Nzambi wuhidika nza na bima bimvimba bimomo, ni yandi Mfumu yi yulu na butoto, mpe kazakalanga mu bibuka bilongo bitungu mu moko ma bantu ko. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Kaa na nsatu yi lusadusu lu bantu ko, bonso ti nsatu yi kima kinandi, ni yandi kwe haananga ku bamvimba luzingu, kihumunu na bima bimvimba. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Yandi wusa ti, makanda mamvimba ma bantu, ma butuka mu muntu wumosi na ma zinga ha luse lumvimba lu butoto. Wubayedikisila zinsungi na wusa ndilu zi bifulu bi bafweti zakidila. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Nzambi wusa bobo, mwanki bamusosa, mpe kaati mu mpasi bamubakula, mpeleko kadyandi kukula na kadi muntu mu yeto ko. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Mu dyambu ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">“Ni mu yandi tuu na luzingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">tukwe ningininanga mpe tudi bonso bu tudi,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Bwabobo mpe bu ta mwa ndambu yi mimbikudi myeno:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">Yeto mpe mu kanda dyandi tudi.”<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Tala ti mu kanda dyandi tudi, tulendi banza ko ti Nzambi kafwanakana na kiteki ki wola, ki palata hoti ki tadi, kihalu mu madyela na mbanzulu zi bantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Bwabu Nzambi zimbakani ntangu zibela bantu ku nsye bunzimbu. Kansi, Nzambi wuna lomba bwabu ku bantu bamvimba, mu bifulu bimvimba bi badi bavilula madyela. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Mu dyambu ti wuzenga kilumbu ki kaafundisa nza mu lunungu, mu nzila yi muntu wukasoola. Wulonka kimbangi ku bamvimba bu kamufulukisa mu bafwa.»<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Bu bayuwa Pawuli bukedi zonzila dyambu di mfulukulu yi bafwa, mwa ndambu yi bantu yimuseha, na bahiika bata ti: «Mu musamu bewowo, mbo tukuyuwa kilumbu kihiika.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ni hahoho Pawuli kasala basisa. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Kansi mwa ndambu yi bantu yimunama na yikwikila. Ha kati dyawu, haba na Deni, wumosi mu zimfumu zi Alewopaze, na mukento wumosi nkumbu andi Damalise, na bahiika dyaka.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ku mbanza yi Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Ku manima, Pawuli wusisa mbanza yi Ateni, na wuyenda ku mbanza yi Kolinto. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Wubwana koko Muyudayo wumosi nkumbu andi Akilase, mwisi-kizunga ki Ponte, kantama yiyingi ko kafumini ku nsi yi Itali ha kimosi na mukento andi, nkumbu andi Pilisile. Mu dyambu ti ntinu Kolode wutuma ku Bayudayo bamvimba bakatuka ha mbanza yi Loma. Pawuli ni kayenda ba kintwadi nawu, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />mu dyambu ti kisalu kimosi balongoka, kye hidikanga zinzo zi bikapu. Wuzakala na wusala ha kimosi nawu.<verse eid="ACT 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Kadi saba, Pawuli wedi zonzanga mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, na wedi sosanga mu leba Bayudayo na Bangeleke.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silase na Timote bafuma ku nsi yi Masedwani bu batuula, Pawuli yandi ni ka kiyekola mvimba mu samuna mambu ma Nzambi. Wedi tanga kimbangi ha ntadisi yi Bayudayo ti Yesu, Mesiya kadi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Kansi Bayudayo bu bedi mubangisanga na kutukanga, wukubula fundu-fundu di binkutu byandi na wubateela ti: «Bika menga meno mabwa ha yulu mutu eno! Meno wuvedila nidi. Tuka kilumbu bekiki, ku balembolo ba Bayudayo naakwenda.» <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Bu kakatuka hoho, wuyenda ku nzo yi bakala dimosi nkumbu andi Titiyusi Yusutuse, kwe toma sambilanga Nzambi, mpe nzo andi yiba bela-bela na nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipusi, mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, wukwikila mu Mfumu na kanda dyandi dimvimba. Bantu ba mbanza yi Kolinto babingi bedi yuwa Pawuli, bakwikila, mpe na babotoko.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Mu mpimpa, Mfumu wuta ku Pawuli mu mbweno ti: «Kuyenandi bunkuta ko, kansi zonza, kukangandi munwa ko, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />mu dyambu ti nii kintwadi naaku mpe kunaani muntu waakusimba mu kuyenisa mpasi. Kadi, mukangu wuwingi wuu naani mu kati di mbanza beyiyi.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pawuli wuzakala koko mvula yimvimba na ngonda sambanu, mu longanga ha kati dyawu mambu ma Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baneti Pawuli ku Ngalyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Mu ntangu Ngalyoni yikaba munyadi mu kizunga ki Akayi, Bayudayo bayuwasana mu nangumukina Pawuli. Bamunata ku nzo yi lufundusu, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />ni bata ti: «Bakala bedidi dina sindisila bantu mu sambila Nzambi mu nzila yilembolo fwanakana na Misiku.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pawuli bu kasaka zonza, Ngalyoni wuvutula ku Bayudayo ti: «Yeno Bayudayo, tala ti musamu wumbi hoti we kutengodila menga, nganunu nketi luyuwa bonso bufwanakani. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Kansi bu wudi kwandi ti musamu wu mayuma matadidi zimpova, zinkumbu na Misiku myeno, myo milutedi. Mbisidi kwani mu ba mumfundisi mu misamu mibobobo.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Ni kabaduukisa mu nzo yi lufundusu. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ni hahoho bamvimba babwidila Sositeni, mfumu yi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. Bamututa nkuba ha mutwala wu nzo yi lufundusu. Kansi Ngalyoni wuyena myo misamu mi mpamba.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli vutukidi ku mbanza yi Antiose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pawuli wuzingila dyaka mwa bilumbu bibingi mu mbanza yi Kolinto. Mboki, wusisa zimpangi, wukota masuwa na wuyenda ku kizunga ki Siliya ha kimosi na Pilisile na Akilase. Bamuhempa kungulu ha Senkeli mu dyambu ti nsilulu kasa. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Bu batuula mu mbanza yi Efeso, Pawuli ha kasala sisa Pilisile na Akilase. Wuyenda kota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo na wumokana na Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bamulomba kazakala bilumbu bibingi, kansi wubisa. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Wubasiisa na wuta ti: «Mbo navutuka ku yeno tala ti Nzambi tiidi.» Wukota masuwa ha mbanza yi Efeso mu kwenda. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Bu kakulumuka ha mbanza yi Sezale, ni katomboka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu kwe haana dibundu mbote. Mboki, wuyenda ku mbanza yi Antiose. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Wuhyokisa mwa bilumbu hoho, mboki ni kayenda. Wuzyeta mu bizunga bi Ngalatiya na Filizi, mu kwe syamisi milongoki mimvimba.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apolose ku mbanza yi Efeso na yi Kolinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Muyudayo wumosi mwisi-mbanza yi Alezandi, nkumbu andi Apolose wuyiza tuula ku mbanza yi Efeso. Wuba naludede lwe zonzila mpe wutoma longoka bumbote Masonama. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Wulongoka nzila yi Mfumu, mpe wuba na vema didingi, wedi samunanga na wedi longisanga misamu mitadidi Yesu mu kikedika kimvimba. Kansi mbotokolo yi Yoane kwandi kazaba. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Wutona mu zonza mu kivuvu kimvimba mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo. Bu bamana muyuwa, Pilisile na Akilase bamunata ha nsoso mu mubangudila mu kikedika kimvimba nzila yi Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Mpe Apolose bu katya mu kwenda ku kizunga ki Akayi, zimpangi zi mu syamisa na zisonikina milongoki mukanda mwanki bamutambula bumbote. Bu katuula, mu mulemvo wu Nzambi, wuyenika muntu wumfunu ku yobobo bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Mu dyambu ti, wedi bangisanga mu ngolo Bayudayo ha meso ma bantu, mpe wedi balonka mu Masonama ti Yesu Mesiya kadi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ku mbanza yi Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Mu ntangu yiba Apolose ku mbanza yi Kolinto, Pawuli wuhyokila yi kizunga ki milandu ki Aziya na wutuula ku mbanza yi Efeso. Wubwana koko mwa ndambu yi milongoki, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />na wubateela ti :«Nga lutambula Mpeve Yilongo mu ntangu yi lukwikila e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Yeto tuyuwa kani fyoti ko ti bana zonzila Mpeve Yilongo.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Wufuula ti: «Nkye mbotokolo bwabu lutambula e?» Bamuvutudila ti: «Mbotokolo yi Yoane.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Pawuli wubateela ti: «Yoane wubotika yobobo batambula mu vilula madyela, mpe wulomba ku mukangu wu Isaeli wukwikila mu yondowo wedi kwiza ku manima mandi, ni Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Bu bamana yuwa mpova bezozo, batambula mbotokolo mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pawuli bu kabatentika moko, Mpeve Yilongo ni yikulumuka mu yawu na batona mu zonza ndinga zinzenza na mu bikula. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Kampe bantu kumi na bole baba.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Ku manima, Pawuli wukota mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, mu kedi zonzila na kivuvu kimvimba. Wuzonzila kimfumu ki Nzambi mu ngonda zitatu, mpe wedi sosa ti yobobo bedi muyuwa bakwikila. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kansi mwa ndambu yikanga mutima na yibisa mu kwikila, yedi vweza nzila yi Mfumu ha ntadisi yi bundu dimvimba. Pawuli wusala basisa na wuyenda ha luhengo ha kimosi na milongoki. Mpe kadi kilumbu, wedi bazonzilanga mu nzo yi ndongosolo yi muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Tilanusi. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Kisalu kizingila mvula zole, ku manima, bantu ba kizunga ki Aziya, Bayudayo na balembolo ba Bayudayo, bayuwa Mambu ma Mfumu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baala ba Seva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Nzambi wedi sanga bimangu bingitukulu mu Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Bedi bonganga milele hoti bitende bikusama nitu yi Pawuli. Mpe bakusa byo ku zimbevo. Mbevo zinyaka na mpeve zimbi ziduuka mu yawu.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Mwa ndambu yi Bayudayo, mimpyoka nzila mikwe kumingi mpeve zimbi, basinsa yawu mpe mu sadila nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu mu yobobo baba balwatu ku mpeve zimbi. Bata ti: «Tululombidi luduuka mu nkumbu yi Yesu bewowo wuna samuna Pawuli.» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Yobobo bedi sanga bobo, ni baala nsambwadi ba Seva, Muyudayo wumosi, mfumu nganga-Nzambi kaba. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Mpeve yimbi ni yibavutudila ti: «Yesu yandi nzebi, mpe nzebi Pawuli nani kadi. Bwabu yeno banani ludi e?» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Muntu wuba na mpeve yimbi wubwa mu nitu zawu, wubavudila ngolo na wubayenisa mpasi zizingi. Mpe, mpene baduuka mu nzo beyoyo na nitu zawu zifuluka mu mputa. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Musamu bewowo wuzabakana ku Bayudayo bamvimba na Bangeleke bedi zinganga ku mbanza Efeso, bayiza ba na bunkuta bubwingi na bakembila bunene bu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Babingi mu yobobo bakwikila bedi kwizanga mu fungula ha meso ma bantu misamu mimbi mi basa. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Mwa babingi mu yobobo bedi sadilanga mikisi batwala mabuuku mawu na bayoka mo ha ntadisi yi bantu bamvimba. Bateza ntalu yi mabuuku bemomo, kampe yiba mafunda kumi ma mbongo zi bisengo. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Bwabobo Mambu ma Mfumu medi kwe mwangininingi, na medi kwe yenikisingi lulendo.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvwanzi ku Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Misamu bemyomyo bu mihyoka, Pawuli wukubika nzyetolo mu kwenda ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, wuhyokila mu kizunga ki Masedwani na ki Akayi na wuta ti: «Bu naatuula koko, mfweti kwenda mpe ku mbanza yi Loma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Wutambika ku kizunga ki Masedwani bilandi byandi byole, Timote na Elasiti. Yandi bende wusala dyaka mwa bilumbu ku kizunga ki Aziya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mvwanzi yingolo yibwa mu dyambu ditadidi nzila yi Mfumu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kisadi kimosi ki palata, nkumbu andi Demetiyuse, wedi hidikanga mu palata mwa zinzo zi nzambi zi Alitemise, nzambi yi mukento, mpe wedi haananga ku bisadi mbongo zizingi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Wukutikisa bisadi byandi ha kimosi na yobobo bedi salanga kisalu kimosi na yawu. Wubateela ti: «Bakundi bani, luzebi ti mubakulu weto mu kisalu bekiki wudi.» <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Bwabu luna yena na luna yuwa, ka ku mbanza yi Efeso kaka ko, kansi fisidi kwa natee mu kizunga kimvimba ki Aziya, Pawuli bewowo wulendidi mu sa ti mpumbu yi bantu yikwikila na yilanda nzila yihiika. Wubateedidi ti binzambi-nzambi bihiduku mu moko ma bantu, bii zinzambi ko. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ka kisalu kyeto kaka ko kilendi vwezo, kansi bwasa mpe ti mfunu yi nzo-nzambi yi Alitemise, nzambi yi mukento, yi manisa. Bumosi mpe balendi kulula dyaka bunene bu kimfumu ki mukento bewowo wu bakwe sambilanga ku bantu ba kizunga ki Aziya na baa mu nza yimvimba.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Bu bayuwa bobo, babaka mankesi mangitukulu na batona mu looka ti: «Masiika ku Alitemise yi bantu ba Efeso!» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mvwanzi yikota mu mbanza yimvimba. Ha kimosi bamvimba balundumuka ku nzo yi bimpa, bu bedi hyoka basala twadikisa Ngayusi na Alisitalaki, bantu ba kizunga ki Masedwani, bakundi ba nzyetolo ba Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pawuli wutya mu kilonka ha ntadisi yi mukangu, kansi milongoki mimudika, <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />mpe mwa ndambu yi bisadi bi luyalu bi kizunga ki Aziya, baba bakundi bandi, ba mutambikila muntu wumosi mu mulomba kabika mu kwenda ku nzo yi bimpa. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Mu ntangu beyoyo, mvwanzi yikota ha kati di lukutakanu, bantu balooka mu dyambu dimosi, bahiika mu dyambu dikaka. Buna babingi bedi lembolo zaba nki bayonzimina. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Bantu ha kati di mpumbu yibangula musamu ku Alezandeli, yondowo Bayudayo wu bateekisa ku mutwala. Bu kalabikisa, wutya mu zonza ku mukangu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kansi, bu babakula ti Muyudayo kaba, bamvimba balooka bilokola byole mu ndinga yimosi ti: «Masiika ku Alitemise yi bantu ba mbanza yi Efeso!»<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kisoniki ki mbanza, kilenda mu dingimisa mpumbu yi bantu na wuta ti: «Bantu ba mbanza yi Efeso, nkye muntu zimbakani ti mbanza yi Efeso, yawu yii nkebi yi nzo-nzambi yi Alitemise, nzambi yiyinene yi mukento na kiteki kyandi kibwa tuka ku yulu e?» <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Dyambu bedyodyo balendi dye bindila mpaka ko. Buna dingameno mpe luhidikilandi dyo mu nswalu ko. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Lutwedi bantu bebaba ehaha balembolo yiba kima ki nzo-nzambi mpe basafudi nzambi eto yi mukento ko. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Tala ti Demetiyuse na bakundi bandi ba kisalu dyambu dii nawu na muntu, tuna zinzo zi lufundusu na mimfundisi. Kokoko bafweti fundila musamu. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Mpe tala ti luu na misamu mihiika, myaahiduku mu kati di lukutukunu luzabakani ku luyaalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Tulembolo sa keba, balendi tufuunda bonso bantu banangumukini mu mi mihyokidi bubedidi. Twaalenda ko mu haana mbangululu yifwanakani mu kuyonzama bekuku. Bu kamana zonza bobo, wutulula lukutukunu.<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuvutuka ku nsi yi Masedwane na yi Ngelese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Mvwanzi bu yimanisa, Pawuli wukutikisa milongoki na wubasyamisa. Mboki, wubahaana mbote yi mansukina na wuyenda ku kizunga ki Masedwani. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Bu kedi hyokila mu kizunga bekyokyo; wedi kwe syamisa zimpangi. Mboki wuyenda ku kizunga ki Ngelese, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />ku kazakala ngonda zitatu. Wuba na mabanza me kota masuwa mu kwenda ku kizunga ki Siliya, kansi bu kayuwa ti Bayudayo bamukotila manenga. Buna wusoola kwandi mu bwesa vutukila yi kizunga ki Masedwani. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Bayenda ha kimosi nandi, ni eba: Sopatele mwana wu Piluse mwisi-Beli, Alisitalaki na Sekunduse bisi-Tesalonika, Ngayusi mwisi-Delebi na Timote, mpe Tisiki na Tofimi bantu ba kizunga ki Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Yawu batuteekidila na bayenda tukingila ha mbanza yi Towasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ku manima ma mukembo wu mampa ma kiputi kikwe lembolo vimbanga, yeto tukotila masuwa ha mbanza yi Filipi. Bilumbu bitanu bihyoka, tuyenda babwana ha mbanza yi Towasi, ha tuhyokisila nawu lumingu lumosi.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wufulukisa Etikuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Kilumbu ki lumingu, tuba bayonzama mu dya, Pawuli bu kazaba ti mbazi waakwenda kwandi, wumokisa zimpangi, na wuzingisa kimoko natee mu kati-kati di mpimpa. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Minda mimingi miba mu kihinga kii ku yulu ki tuba bakutakana. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Toko dimosi nkumbu andi Etikuse, wuba wuzakala ha nela. Wubwa tolo tumpondi ntangu yimvimba yedi zonzanga Pawuli, ni kasonoka tuka kibandu kitatu ki nzo yi kibanga natee ha nsi. Basosa mu mutedimisa, kansi wukifwila. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Pawuli wukulumuka, wuyinama ha ntadisi andi na wumusimba mu moko mandi na wuta ti: «Luyenandi mutima mpasi ko, wuu kwandi wumoyo.» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Wubwesa maka dyaka ku yulu. wubukuna dimpa na wudya. Mboki, wutatamana kimoko kyandi natee mu minkyela mi bwisi. Ni kayenda. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Toko bedyodyo bavutula dyo dimoyo mpe musamu bewowo wunata syamusunu ku bamvimba.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzyetolo ku mbanza Towase natee ku mbanza Mile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Yeto tukota masuwa mu tekila ku mbanza yi Asosi, ku tufweni sala hitula Pawuli. Mu dyambu ti, mu malu kayendila koko bonso bu kazengila wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Bu katubwana ha mbanza yi Asosi, tusala muhitula mu masuwa mu kwenda ku mbanza yi Mitileni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Bu tukatuka hoho, tutatamana nzyetolo mu masuwa, mu kilumbu kilanda tutuula ha simu di mbanza yi Kiyo. Kilumbu kilanda dyaka, tuyenda tuula ha mbanza yi Samosi, mpe kilumbu kibwesa landa, ni tuyenda tuula ha mbanza yi Mile. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pawuli wubonga nzengolo mu lutakana ha mbanza yi Efeso mu mamba masunda, mwanki kalembolo hyokisa ntangu ku kizunga ki Aziya. Wedi kwe bingidi, tala ti bulenda ba, ka kituudila ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu kilumbu ki Pentekoti.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na Bankuluntu ba mbanza yi Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Tuka ku mbanza yi Mile, Pawuli wutambika ntumi benda batumisa bankuluntu ba dibundu baa ku mbanza Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Bu batuula ha ntadisi andi, wubateela ti: «Luzebi bwedi nakwe dyatilanga neeno, tuka kilumbu ki natuula mu kizunga ki Aziya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Meno nasadidi Mfumu ku nsye luyinunu lumvimba, mpe manswela mu meso, mu kati di mfyetokoso zedi nsosilanga mfundu zi Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Luzebi ti, na lusweka dyambu ko bu nalusamunina mpe bu nalulongisa mimvimba miba neeno kisalu ha meso ma bantu na mu zinzo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nalomba ku Bayudayo na ku Bangeleke bavilula madyela mu bangumuka ku Nzambi na bakwikila mu Mfumu eto Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Bwabu, nina kwenda ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi bonso buna ntumina Mpeve Yilongo, mpe nzebi ko nkye dyambu dyantudila koko. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Nzebi kwandi ti, mu kadi mbanza, Mpeve Yilongo wuna ndwengisa mu mpasi na boloko bina nkingila. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Kansi, luzingu lwani, luu naani mfunu ko. Kima kii naani mfunu, ni mu lungisa nsilulu yi kisalu ki mpana Mfumu Yesu: Kisalu kye samuna Musamu Wumbote wutadidi mambote ma Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Tuka kilumbu bekiki, nzebi ti, yeno bamvimba bana samunini Kimfumu ki Nzambi bu nedi kwe zyeti, lwaabwesa yena kini kyani ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ni hahoho, nina luteela kimbangi bubedidi ti: wonso muntu waazimbala kwandi nzila yi Nzambi, mintadidi dyaka ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Mu dyambu ti nalusamunini mimvimba mikana Nzambi mu luzabikisa, wulembolo sweka dyambu dimosi ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Kikebeeno kweno yeno bende na mukangu wuluhaana Mpeve Yilongo mu keba. Vungeeno bumbote Dibundu di Nzambi di kakuula mu menga mandi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Nzebi ti ku manima mani, zingo zimbalu zaafyolomoka ha kati dyeno na zaavukisa mukangu ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Ha kati dyeno mpe haatotoka bihuni mu nata milongoki mu nzila zawu. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ni hahoho, kayeeno meso na bambukeeno moyo ti, mu mvula zitatu zimvimba, mpimpa na mwini, manswela mu meso, nabebidi ko mu lulwengisa wumosi-wumosi mu yeno.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Bwabu, nina luyekola mu moko ma Nzambi na mu bumbote bu Mambu mandi maa na lulendo mu lutunga na mu haana fwa ku yobobo bamvimba ba kavwidi. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Nabedi na nsatu yi mbongo ko, yi wola ko, na yi binkutu bi muntu wumosi ko. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Yeno bende waluzebi ti mu ngolo zi moko mani na bee sadilanga mu yukutisa nsatu zaani na zi banaani. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Nalulonkisi mu mimvimba bwedi lufweti sadila mu sadisa bamputu, mpe mu bambuka moyo Mambu ma Mfumu Yesu, bu kata yandi bende ti: Kukaba kuhyokidi kyese na kutambula.»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Bu kamana zonza, wufukama na wusambila ha kimosi na yawu bamvimba. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Bamvimba badila na balelama mu nsingu yi Pawuli mu mufiba. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Kyadi kitumbu bahyokila kitezo bu kata ti baabwesa muyena ko. Mboki, bayenda mufila natee ha masuwa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna tomboka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Bu tumana hambana, ni tukota masuwa mu nzila yi mubu, mu kwenda ku kizanga ki Kose, mboki kilumbu kilanda, tuyenda ku kizanga ki Lodesi. Bu tukatuka hoho, ni tuyenda ku mbanza yi Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Tubwana koko masuwa medi kwenda ku kizunga ki Fenisi. Tukota momo, na tuyenda. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Bu tuyenda ba bela-bela na kizanga ki Sipeli, ni tuyendisa ku lumoso lu kizanga bekyokyo, mu kwenda ku nsi yi Siliya. Tutuula ha mbanza yi Tile na masuwa makangama mu kulumuna bifunda. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Bu tubakula milongoki mi ba hoho, ni tuzakala kisabala kimvimba hoho. Mpeve Yilongo yibalwengisa, ni balomba ku Pawuli kabika mu kwenda ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kisabala bu kimanisa, ni tuyenda. Milongoki mimvimba miyenda tufila ha kimosi na bakento, na baala natee ku mbazi yi mbanza. Tufukama ha kumu di mubu na tusambila. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ku manima me haanasana zimbote zimanunu, tukota mu masuwa. Yawu ni bavutuka ku zinzo zawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tumanisa nzyetolo eto yi mu mamba, tuka mbanza yi Tile natee ku mbanza yi Pitolemayisi. Tuhaana zimbote ku zimpangi hoho, mpe tuhyokisa kilumbu kimvimba nawu. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Kilumbu kilanda, ni tuvutuka ku mbanza yi Sezale. Tukota mu nzo yi Filipi, mulongisi wu Musamu Wumbote, ni tuzakala momo. Yandi wuba wumosi mu bantu nsambwadi babasoola ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ndumba ziya zilembolo zaba babakala ziba nandi, zedi bikulanga. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Bu tuzakala bilumbu bibingi hoho, mumbikudi wumosi wufuma ku kizunga ki Yuda, wuyiza tuula, nkumbu andi Angabusi. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Bu kayiza tuyenikina, wubonga melika yi Pawuli, wukanga moko na malu mandi, na wuta ti: «Mpeve Yilongo ebu kateedi: muntu vwidi melika beyiyi, bwabobo mpe Bayudayo bamubindikila misinga ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mpe baamuyekodila mu moko ma banzenza.» <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Bu tuyuwa bobo, yeto na minkwikidi mi mbanza yi Sezale, tubombidila Pawuli kabika mu tomboka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kansi wubavutudila ti: «Nki luna didila na nki luna ntatikisila mutima e? Meno nkubamani kaka mu binduku misinga ko, kansi na mu fwa ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu dyambu di Mfumu Yesu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Bu kabisa mu tuyuwila, yeto mpe ni tubiika kweto. Ni tumuteela ti: «Bika luzolo lu Mfumu luvangama.»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Mwa bilumbu bihyoka, bu tukubama, ni tutomboka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Mwa ndambu yi milongoki mi mbanza yi Sezale miyenda ha kimosi neto. Mitunata ku nzo yi muntu wumosi ku tulambidila. Nkumbu andi Masoni, mwisi-Sipeli. Wuba mulongoki tuka ntama.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na bakuluntu ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Bu tutuula ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, zimpangi zitubwana mu kyese. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Kilumbu kilanda, Pawuli wuyenda ha kimosi neto ku nzo yi Zaki ku mana kutakana bakuluntu ba dibundu. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Bu kamana bahaana mbote, wubayadila mimvimba mihidika Nzambi mu kisalu kyandi ha kati di balembolo ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Bu bamana muyuwa, batona mu kembila Nzambi. Mboki bamuteela ti: «Yeni, mpangi eto, nkye mpila lutangu lu mafunda ma Bayudayo meka minkwikidi, mpe bamvimba bana lonka vema mu zitisa Misiku. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Kansi, yawu bayudi ti ngeye wuna sindisila Bayudayo bakwe zinganga ha kati di yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, balosa Misiku mi Mose, babika mu zengoso baala bawu bubakala mpe babika mu landa kinkulu ki Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nki bifwanakani mu sa e? Mu dyambu ti yawu baazaba ti ngeye tuudidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Sadila bwabu mi twaakuteela. Babakala baya baa neto haha badidi ndefi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Yenda nawu, ba kintwadi nawu bu baasa mukembo wu mvedosolo, mpe bafutila mbongo mwanki babahempa makungulu ku mutu. Bwabobo bantu bazabila ti misamu mibayudi mu nitu aku, mi luvunu kwandi midi. Kansi, ngeye mpe kwe tumamanga mu Misiku mi Mose. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo beka minkwikidi, tubasonikini mubahaana ntumunu eyi: ka mu dyanga bibulu bi baheeni munkayulu ku biteki ko, ka menga ko, ka bibulu bifwidi bilembolo zengo ngongodinga ko, mpe ka musanga kindumba ko.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Pawuli wunata babakala bebobo na wukivedisa ha kimosi nawu. Mpe kilumbu kilanda, wuyenda kota mu nzo-Nzambi mu zabikisa kilumbu ki baakanga mukembo wu mvedosolo, na ntangu kadi muntu yi kahaanina munkayulu andi.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakengi Pawuli mu nzo-Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Kisabala bu kiba bela-bela mu hwa, Bayudayo ba kizunga ki Aziya bu bayena Pawuli mu nzo-Nzambi, banangumuna mukangu wumvimba na bamubwila. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Babulana ti: «Ba-Isaeli, tubakiseeno! Taleeno muntu bewuwu wuna kwe haani ku bamvimba, mu ndambu ka ndambu, ndongosolo yi lembolo fwanakana, yina mwangisa mukangu, Misiku mi Mose na nzo-Nzambi. Bwabu, kotisi mpe mu nzo-Nzambi bantu balembolo ba Bayudayo na safudi mpe kibuka bekiki kilongo!» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Mu dyambu ti batekidi yena Tofimi, mwisi-Efeso, ha kimosi nandi mu kati di mbanza. Ni bayindudi ti Pawuli wumukotisi mu nzo-Nzambi.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Mbanza yimvimba yi nangumuka. Mukangu wufuma mu ndambu ka ndambu, wuyiza mu ntinu . Babwila Pawuli, bamuduukisa ku mbazi yi nzo-Nzambi, ni batumbu kanga myelo. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Bu bedi sosa mu honda Pawuli, kansi mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma wuyuwa ti mvwanzi yikotidi ha mbanza yimvimba yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Wutumbu yonzika zimbulu-mbulu na mfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, ziyenda kubela mukangu. Bantu bu bayena mfumu beyoyo na zimbulu-mbulu, ni babika mu tuta Pawuli nkuba. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wufinama ha Pawuli. Wumukangusu na wutuma bamubindika misinga myole mi bisengo. Mboki, wufuula nani kadi mpe nkye musamu kasiidi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Kansi, mu kati di mpumbu, bantu balookana mu ta musamu wumosi, bahiika mu ta musamu wuhiika. Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu bukedi lembolo bakula kani dyambu dimosi mu dyambu di mvwanzi, ni katuma banata Pawuli mu boloko. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pawuli bu katuula mu bikada, zimbulu-mbulu ni zimunanguna mu dyambu di mpumbu yi bantu yedi sa mvwanzi yingolo. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Bantu babingi bedi kwe balandi, bedi kwe bulani ti: «Kafwa!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna nwanina nitu andi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Mu ntangu yi bedi saka mu mukotisa mu boloko, Pawuli wuta ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu ti: «Nga lendi mpaana luve lwe zonza mwa dyambu e?» Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wumufuula ti: «Zebi mu zonza kingeleke e? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Ka ngeye ko mwisi-Ngipiti bewowo, wusidi ti bantu banangumuka mwa bilumbu bebibi mpe wuneti ku nsi yinkatu mafunda maya ma binkita bi na mata e?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pawuli wumuvutudila ti: «Meno, Muyudayo nidi. Nabutuka ku mbanza yi Talisi mu kizunga ki Silisi, muntu wu mbanza yimfunu. Ndemvokila, mpaana luve nazonza ku mukangu.» <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wumuhaana luve lwe zonza. Pawuli wutelama ha yulu bikada, wulabikisa mukangu. Bamvimba badingama na Pawuli wubazonzila mu ndinga yi kihebeleo:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«Mpangi zani na matata mani, yuweeno bwabu misamu mii nani mu luteela mu nwanina nitu ani.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Bu bayuwa ti Pawuli wuna bazonzila mu ndinga yi kihebeleo, ni batoma ba dyaka na swii. Pawuli wuta bwabu ti : <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Meno Muyudayo nidi, nabutuka ku mbanza yi Talisi, mu kizunga ki Silisi. Kansi, bankudisa mu mbanza beyiyi yi Yelusalemi, mpe Ngamalyeli wuba mulongi ani mu toma zaba Misiku mi zinkaka zeto. Naba na vema kukwingi mu sadila Nzambi, bonso buludi bubedidi yeno bamvimba. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Meno natoma fyetikisa natee mu sosa mu honda bantu bakwe landanga nzila yi Mfumu. Nakangisa bakento na babakala mpe nabatuba mu boloko. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mfumu nganga-Nzambi na kimvuka ki bakuluntu badi zimbangi. Mu dyambu ti yawu bampana mikanda mitadidi zimpangi zeto zii ku mbanza yi Damasi, ku nayenda mu kwe kanga minkwikidi, na mu banata ku Yelusalemi bakangama mu misinga, mwanki batambula nsembolo.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna zonzila mvilukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«Bu naba mu nzila, bela-bela na mbanza yi Damasi, kampe yiba ntangu ha mbata, nayitukulu kwani ni kya kikingi kifuma ku yulu, kitumbu nzungidila mu kyezezi kyandi. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Nabwa ha nsi mpe nayuwa ndinga yedi nteela ti : “Sawuli, Sawuli, bila nki wuna mfyetikisila e?” <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Namufuula ti: “Mfumu, ngeye ni nani e? Wumvutudila ti: Meno ni Yesu mwisi Nazaleti, yondowo wu wuna fyetikisa.” <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Yobobo bazyeta ha kimosi nani, bayena kya, kansi bayuwa ndinga yi yondowo wedi nzonzila ko. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Nina fuula ti: “Mfumu, nki nafweti sa e?” Mfumu wunteela ti: “Telama, yenda ku mbanza yi Damasi, koko baakuteela nki fweti sa”. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Nedi bwesa yena ko, mu dyambu kya bekyokyo kinkitula mpofo. Ni hahoho, bantu bayenda nani, bansimba mu kooko mu nata ku mbanza yi Damasi.»<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Muntu wumosi wuba koko, nkumbu andi Ananiase, wuba bakala dyedi vuminanga Nzambi na dikwikama mu Misiku. Mpe Bayudayo bamvimba ba mbanza yi Damase, bedi muteelanga kimbangi kimbote, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />bu kayiza ha naba, wunteela ti: “Sawuli, mpangi ani, bika meso maku mabwesa yena!” Hansi na nsi, meso mani mazibuka mpe namuyena. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Wubwesa muteela dyaka ti: “Nzambi yi zinkaka zeto wukusoodidi mu zaba luzolo lwandi, mu yena muntu wulunungu, mpe mu yuwa ndinga andi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Mu dyambu ti, waaba mbangi andi ha ntadisi yi bantu bamvimba mu myo mi waayena na mi waayuwa. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Bwabu, nki wuna kingila e? Telama, yiza wubotoko mpe tambula ndemvokolo yi masumu maku mu sambila mu nkumbu andi.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli bamutambika ku balembolo ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«Bu navutuka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mu ntangu yi nedi sambila mu nzo-Nzambi, ni nakota mu mpeve. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Nayena Mfumu wedi nteela ti: “Duuka mu muswalu mu mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mu dyambu ti bantu baatambula kimbangi ki wuna nteela ko.” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Ni navutula ti: “Mfumu, batomini zaba ti nedi kotanga mu kadi nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo mu tuula mu boloko na mu zubusu bikoti yobobo bakwe kukwikilanga.” <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Mpe mu ntangu yi bedi tengola menga ma Tyeni, mbangi aku, meno mpe ho naba. Nasingisa yobobo bedi muhonda mpe meno nedi keba binkutu byawu. <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Mfumu ni kanteela bwabu ti: “Yenda, mu dyambu ti kukula nina kutambika, ku balembolo ba Bayudayo.”»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli na mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Mpumbu yi bantu yiyuwa Pawuli natee ku nsukunu yi kinzonzi kyandi. Kansi, bamvimba batona mu bulana ti: «Zimbisa muntu bewuwu ha luse lu butoto! Ka mfunu mu zinga ko!» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Bu bedi bulana, bakatula binkutu byawu ni bedi kwe tubi fundu-fundu mu yulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wutuma bakotisa Pawuli mu kivwandulu ki zimbulu-mbulu na zimuzuba bikoti mwanki kazonza, mpe zizaba mu dyambu di nki bantu bana kwe mukumbidi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Kansi, mu ntangu yi bedi mukanga misinga mu muzuba bikoti, Pawuli wuta ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama yi ba hoho ti: «Nga wuna luve mu zuba mwisi-Loma bikoti wulembolo fundusu e?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Bu kayuwa bobo, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama wuyenda teela mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu ti: «Nki keti sa e? Mu dyambu ti muntu bewuwu mwisi-Loma wudi.» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wuyenda ha ntadisi yi Pawuli na wumufuula ti: «Nteela, ngeye nkatika mwisi-Loma wudi e?» Ni katambula ti: «Ninga». <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wuta dyaka ti: «Meno mbongo zizingi nafuta mu ba mwisi-Loma.» Kansi Pawuli wuta ti: «Meno nidi mwisi-Loma wu mbutuka.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Yobobo baketa muzuba bikoti mwanki kazonza batumbu mutatukila, na mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wuyena bunkuta bu kabakula ti Pawuli mwisi-Loma kaba na bu katuma bamukanga misinga.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Kilumbu kilanda, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wusosa mu zaba kikedika ki kibila kyedi mufundila Bayudayo. Wulomba bamunyanguna mpe wutuma ku mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na ku kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo bayonzama. Mboki, wulomba banata Pawuli. Ni kamutuula ha kati dyawu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pawuli wusungimina kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo na wuta ti: «Mpangi zani, ndyatulu ani yimbote yidi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi natee kilumbu ki bubedidi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mfumu nganga-Nzambi Ananiase wutuma ku yobobo baba bela-bela nandi bamukata mu munwa. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ni hahoho Pawuli kamuteela ti: «Ngeye Nzambi kakaata, bonso kibaka ki bakusidi mpemba wudi! Ngeye zakadi ehaha mu mfundisa bonso buna tumina Misiku, hoti mu safula myo bu wuna lomba ti bankaata e?» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Yobobo baba bela-bela na Pawuli, bamuteela ti: «Mfumu nganga-Nzambi wuna tuka!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pawuli wuvutula ti: «Mpangi zani, nkwe zaba ko ti mfumu nganga-Nzambi kadi. Mu dyambu ti wusonama: “Kutukandi mfumu di kanda dyaku ko!”»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pawuli wuzaba ti mu kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, ndambu baba Basaduki, ndambu yihiika Bafalisi. Wuzonza mu ngolo ha ntadisi awu ti: «Mpangi zani, meno Mufalisi nidi, mwana wu Mufalisi. Mu dyambu di kivuvu kyeto mu mfulukulu mu bafwa nina fundusulu.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Bu kamana zonza bobo, Bafalisi na Basaduki batona muyumana, na nkabani yikota ha bundu. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Mu dyambu ti Basaduki bakwe tanga ti: kuu na mfulukulu yi bafwa ko, kuu na mbazi ko, na kuu na mpeve ko. Kansi Bafalisi yawu bakwe kwikilanga mu mimvimba bemyomyo. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Lusuku luhyokila kitezo, milongisi mi Misiku mii mu kimvuka ki Bafalisi ni mitelama, mikota na kibakala kimvimba mu mayuma, ni mita ti: «Tuyeni dyambu dimbi ku bakala bedidi ko. Ngaa ti mpeve hoti mbazi yi mu zonzidi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Nyuma bu yihyokila kitezo, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu wuyena bunkuta ti bazenga Pawuli mu bibuku ku bantu bebaba. Ni hahoho, kalombila ku zimbulu-mbulu bakulumuka mu kwe bonga Pawuli ha kati di bundu, na bamuvutula mu kivwandulu ki zimbulu-mbulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Mpimpa yilanda, Mfumu wuyenika ku Pawuli na wumuteela ti: «Lwata kibakala, kimbangi ki ntedidi ha mbanza yi Yelusalemi, fweti kye ntela mpe ku mbanza yi Loma.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayudayo bakotila Pawuli manenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kilumbu kilanda na mene, Bayudayo bakota manenga: badya ndefi mu lembolo dya na kunwa tekila bahonda Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Yobobo bakota manenga bemomo baba lutangu kuhyoka makumaya ma bantu. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Bayenda yenikina mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na zi bakuluntu mu bateela ti: «Tudidi ndefi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu lembolo dya tekila tuhonda Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Yeno na kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, lombeeno ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma, ka munata ha ntadisi eno, mwanki lutoma fyongonina musamu andi. Yeto tukubamani mu muhonda tekila katula ehaha.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Kansi, mwana nkazi wu Pawuli, wu bakala, wuyuwa bu bedi zonzila mutambu wubalebika. Wuyenda kota mu kivwandulu ki zimbulu-mbulu mu lwengisa Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Pawuli wutumisa wumosi mu zimfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu nkama na wumuteela ti: «Nata toko bedidi ku mfumu yi bambulu-mbulu yi Loma, mu dyambu ti musamu wuu nandi ka muteela.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama wuyenda ha kimosi nandi ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma. Wuta ku Mfumu yi Loma ti: «Nkole Pawuli wuntumisi na wundombidi na kutwadila toko bedidi. Musamu wuu nandi kakuteela.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma wusimba toko mu kooko, wumunata ha luhengo na wumufuula ti: «Nkye musamu wuu naaku wuwanteela e?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Wuvutula ti: «Bayudayo bayuwasani mu kulomba wunata mbazi Pawuli ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo. Ebu baakuteela ti batiidi mu fyongonina musamu andi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ku bayuwilandi ko, mu dyambu ti bantu kuhyoka lutangu makumi maya ha kati dyawu bamulebikidi mutambu, mpe badidi ndefi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu lembolo dya na kunwa tekila bamuhonda. Bakubama bwabu badi na bana kingila kaka wuhaana luve.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma wuvutula toko. Wumukanina ti: Kutandi ku kaani muntu ko ti musamu wawuntedidi.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batambikidi Pawuli ku mbanza yi Sezale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ku manima, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma wutumisa mfumu zole zi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, wubahaana lutumu elu: «Yonzikeeno nkama zole yi zimbulu-mbulu, makumi nsambwadi ma zimbulu-mbulu zikwe yendilanga mu mpunda na nkama zole yi zimbulu-mbulu zidi na madyonga. Kubameeno mu kwenda mu ngunga yi vwa yi nkokila ku mbanza yi Sezale. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Kubikeeno mpe zimpunda mu nata Pawuli, ha ntadisi yi Munyadi Felikise, wulembolo bwilu dyambu» <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ni kasonika mukanda ewu ti:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«Meno, Kolode Lizyase nasonikini ku ngeye munyadi Felikise, mbote aku! <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Bayudayo bakanga bakala bedidi di nakutambikidi, mpe basosa mu muhonda. Ni nayenda na zimbulu-mbulu zani mu muvuukisa, bu nabakula ti mwisi-Loma wudi. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Bu nasosidi mu zaba kibila ki bana mufundila, ni namuneti ha ntadisi yi kimvuka kyawu ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nabakudi ti, bana mufundila mu misamu mitadidi Misiku myawu. Kansi, mbeki kibila kye muhondila hoti kye mukotisila mu boloko ko. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Mboki bu banteedidi ti Bayudayo bamukotidi manenga, ni ntumbu mutambika ku ngeye, mpe nalombidi ku mimfundi myandi biza bamufundila ha ntadisi aku.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Zimbulu-mbulu ni zilanda ntumunu zi batambula. Zibonga Pawuli, ni bamunata mu mpimpa ku mbanza yi Antipatilise. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Kilumbu kilanda, zimbulu-mbulu ziyendila mu malu, zivutuka ku kivwandulu kyawu. Zimbulu-mbulu zikwe yendilanga mu mpunda, zitatamana nzyetolo na Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Bu zituula ha mbanza yi Sezale, zimbulu-mbulu zikwe yendilanga mu mpunda zihaana mukanda ku munyadi, mboki zisala sisa Pawuli mu moko mandi. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Munyadi bu katanga mukanda, ni kafuula Pawuli mu zaba kizunga ki kafuma. Bu kayuwa ti ku kizunga ki Silisi, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />ni kamuteela ti: «Mbo nakuyuwa mu ntangu mimfundi myaku bu myaatuula.» Mboki, ni katuma bakeba Pawuli mu nzo yi kisalu yi munyadi Elode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Bayudayo bafunda Pawuli ku Munyadi Felikise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Bilumbu bitanu bihyoka, mfumu nganga-Nzambi Ananiase wukulumuka ku mbanza yi Sezale na mwa ndambu yi bakuluntu, mpe na nzonzi yimosi, nkumbu andi Tetule. Bayenda mu kwe funda Pawuli ha ntadisi yi munyadi Felikise. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Bu batumisa Pawuli, Tetule wutona mu mufunda ebu: «Tata mfumu Felikise, tala ti tuna zinga mu nkatika kiyenge, ni mu dyambu dyaku na mu nsadulu yimoona yi wuna sadila mu nsi eto. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tuna toma kutonda mu mimvimba mimbote mi tuna tambula kadi ntangu, mpe mu ndambu ka ndambu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Kansi ndemvokila, mu lembolo hombisa ntangu aku, nakulombidi wutuyuwa mwa fyoti. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tubakudi ti bakala bedidi nkatika muntu wumbi wudi. Wuna mana tuula mvwanzi ha kati di Bayudayo bamvimba baa mu nza. Mfumu yi mwa kabu di ba-Nazili kadi. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Wusala tona mu safula bulongo bu nzo-Nzambi, kansi ni tumukanga. [Mpe tuketi mufundisa bonso budi Misiku myeto, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />kansi, Lizyase mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma bu katuula, wumukatula mu moko meto mu kibakala kimvimba, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />mpe wuhaana lutumu ku mimfundi myandi biza ha ntadisi aku.] Nge bende bu waamufuula, mbo wubakula kwandi kikedika ki misamu mimvimba mi tuna mufundila.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Bayudayo basingisa kimbangi bekyokyo na bata ti: kikedika kidi.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna nwanina nitu andi ha ntadisi yi Munyadi Felikise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Munyadi wulabikisa Pawuli mu kooko mwanki kazonza. Pawuli ni kata ti: «Nazebi ti, tuka mvula zizingi, mumfundisi wudi mu nsi beyiyi. Ni hahoho nidi na kivuvu mu nwanina nitu ani ha ntadisi aku. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Bonso nge bende lenda sosa muzaba kikedika, ha hyokidi bilumbu kumi na byole ko tuuka kilumbu ki nabedi ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mu sambila. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Ha nyeni muntu ko ti nina yumana na muntu hoti nina nangumuna mukangu mu nzo-Nzambi hoti mu nzo yi lusambulu yi Bayudayo, hoti mu kati di mbanza. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Bantu bebaba balendi kulonka kikedika ki misamu bemimi mi bana mfundila ko. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ntambudi ha ntadisi aku ti, nkwe sambilanga Nzambi yi matata meto, mu nzila yi bana tumisina ti kinzabi-nzambi. Meno nakwe kwikilanga mu myo midi misonama mu Misiku na mu buuku di mimbikudi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nidi na kivuvu mu Nzambi ti mfulukulu mu bafwa yi bantu balunungu na balembolo ba balunungu yaaba, bonso yawu mpe baa na kivuvu bekyokyo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ni hahoho, nkwe sadilanga ngolo mu lembolo ba na dyambu mu mutima ha ntadisi yi Nzambi na yi bantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Mvula zizingi zihyoka, ku manima, ni navutuka mu haana mbongo bonso lusadusu ku mukangu ani na mu haana minkayulu ku Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Bwabobo, mwa ndambu yi Bayudayo bafuma ku kizunga ki Aziya, banyena mu nzo-Nzambi mu nedi manisina mvedosolo ani. Nayonzikisa bantu ko mpe natulumuna mvwanzi ko. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Mwa ndambu yi Bayudayo ba kizunga ki Aziya, yawu bafwanakani mu telama ha ntadisi aku mu mfunda, tala ti kibila kii nawu mu meno. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Hoti mpe yawu baa haha, bazonza nkye kibila bambeki na kyo mu ntangu yi nedi fundusu ha ntadisi yi kimvuka ki bakuluntu ba Bayudayo, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />kampe ni musamu wumosi kaka wu naduukisa ha munwa ani ha kati dyawu, bu nata ti: “bubedidi nina fundusu ha ntadisi eno mu dyambu di mfulukulu yi bafwa!”»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felikise wuba wuzaba bumbote myo mitadidi ndongosolo beyoyo yimoona, wubavutula na wuta ti: «Mu ntangu yaakwiza Lizyase, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu yi Loma, mbo nafyongonina musamu eno.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Wutuma ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama kakeba Pawuli, kamuhaana mwa kimpwanza na kabiika bakundi bandi biza bamusadisanga.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ha ntadisi yi Felikise na Dusile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Mwa bilumbu bihyoka, Felikise wuyiza na mukento andi Dusile, wuba Muyudayo. Wulomba batumisa Pawuli. Wumuyuwa mi kazonza mu myo mitadidi kiminu mu Yesu Klisto. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Kansi, Pawuli bu kazonzila misamu mitadidi lunungu, kukiyaala na mfundusu yina kwiza, Felikise wuyena bunkuta. Ni kamuteela ti: «Bufweni bwabu. Bu naabaka ntangu, mbo nabwesa kutumisa.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Wuba na kivuvu ti Pawuli waamuhaana mbongo. Ni hahoho, kedi mana mutumisinanga ntangu zizingi mu zonza nandi. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Mvula zole zihyoka, Polisyuse Fesituse wuyiza hingana ha kibuka ki Felikise. Mu yangidika Bayudayo, Felikise wusala sisa Pawuli mu boloko.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ha ntadisi yi Munyadi Fesituse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Ku manima ma bilumbu bitatu bu katula mu kizunga ki Yuda, Fesituse wusisa mbanza yi Sezale mu tomboka ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na mfumu zi Bayudayo bayenda ha ntadisi andi mu funda Pawuli. Batoma mubombidila <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />mu mulomba kavutula Pawuli ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Mu dyambu ti balebikila Pawuli mutambu mwanki bamuhonda mu nzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kansi, Fesituse wubavutudila ti: «Pawuli wuu mu boloko ku mbanza yi Sezale, mpe neka lukufi, meno bende mu vutuka koko.» <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Wubwesa ta ti: «Bika tukulumuka ha kimosi na zimfumu zeno ku mbanza yi Sezale. Tala ti kibila babeki mu bakala bedyodyo, bamufunda.» <verse eid="ACT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesituse wuhyokisa kaka bilumbu nana hoti kumi ha kati dyawu, ku manima, ni kavutuka ku mbanza yi Sezale. Kilumbu kilanda, wuyenda zakala mu nzo yi lufundusu na wutuma banata Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Pawuli bu katula, Bayudayo bafuma ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi bamuzungidila na bamufunda mu bibila bibingi. Kansi, balembana mu lonka kikedika ki bibila bebyobyo. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Pawuli mu nwanina nitu andi, wuta ti: «Meno nasidi musamu wumbi ko ha ntadisi yi Misiku mi Bayudayo ko, ha natadisi yi nzo-Nzambi, na ha ntadisi yi ntinu ko.»<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Mu yangidika Bayudayo, Fesituse wusa ndombolo eyi ku Pawuli ti: «Nga tiidi tutomboka ku Yelusalemi mwanki bazenga musamu aku ha ntadisi ani e?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Kansi, Pawuli wuvutula ti: «Meno natelamani ha ntadisi yi lufundusu lu Kayisali, hahaha nafweti fundusulu. Nge bende watomini zaba ti, nahidikidi musamu wumbi ku Bayudayo ko.» <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Tala ti ku mbedi nidi, mpe tala ti musamu wumbi nahidikidi wuna sa ti nafwa, nabisidi mu fwa ko. Kansi, tala ti misamu mina mfundila bantu bebaba mii mikedika ko, kuu muntu wuna luve mu nyekola mu moko mawu ko. Meno ndombidi naba ha ntadisi yi Kayisali. <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fesituse bu kamana zonza na milwengisi myandi, wuvutula ti: «Lombidi mu fundusu ha ntadisi yi Kayisali, mbo wenda ha ntadisi andi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ha ntadisi yi Angilipa na Belenise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Mwa bilumbu bihyoka, ntinu Angilipa na kibusi kyandi Belenise batula ha mbanza yi Sezale mu haana Fesituse mbote. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Bu kazaba ti bazingila bilumbu bibingi ha mbanza, Fesituse wuyadila ntinu mpolo yi Pawuli. Wuta ti: «Muntu wuu haha, wusisa Felikise mu boloko.» <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Bu naba ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi na bakuluntu ba Bayudayo bayiza mufunda, mpe balomba bamuzengila kitumbu. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Ni nabavutudila ti: «Bisi-Loma baa na kifu kye zengila muntu kitumbu ko, tala ti bamubwabisi na mimfundi myandi ko, na bamuheeni luve lwe nwanina nitu andi ko.» <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Bayiza ha kimosi nani ehaha. Mpe nakingila ko, kilumbu kilanda ni nazakala ha kyandu mu nzo yi lufundusu, mpe nalomba banata muntu bewowo. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Mimfundi myandi bu mituula, mita kani kibila kimosi ko mu myo mi nedi yindula. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Nyuma kaka ziba nawu mu misamu mitadidi dibundu dyawu, mpe mu muntu wumosi nkumbu andi Yesu, wufwa, kansi Pawuli wuna singisa ti wumoyo kadi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Meno nazaba dyaka ko nki nalendi sa mu musamu bewuwu, nina mulomba kenda ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi mwanki bazenga musamu andi. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kansi, Pawuli wulomba bazenga musamu andi ku Kayisali. Ni hahoho, natuma bamukeba mu boloko natee bu namutambika ku Kayisali Angustu. <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Angilipa wuta ku Fesituse ti: «Natiidi mebende mpe nayuwa muntu bewowo.» Wumuvutudila ti: «Mbazi, waamuyuwa.»<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Kilumbu kilanda, Angilipa na Belenise bayizila mu mukembo wuwunene. Bakota mu nzo yi lufundusu ha kimosi na mfumu zi zimbulu-mbulu na minanga mi mbanza. Mu lutumu lu Fesituse, banata Pawuli. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesituse wuta ti: «Ntinu Angilipa na yeno bamvimba luu kintwadi neto, luyeni muntu bewuwu. Mukangu wumvimba wu Bayudayo wumufundidi ku meno, bu nabedi ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi natee ehaha, mwanki bamuzengila lufwa.» <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mu meno, namubeki kibila ki balendi muzengila lufwa ko. Kansi, yandi bende lombidi ku Kayisali Angustu kazenga musamu andi. Ni hahoho nabongidi zengolo mu mutambika koko. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mpeleko nabeki dyambu dye sonika ku Mfumu mu dyambu dyandi ko, kansi namufundisi ha ntadisi eno, vula-vula ha ntadisi yi ngeye ntinu Angilipa, mwanki nabaka mwa dyambu dye sonika, bu lwaamanisa mu muzika byuhu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Mu dyambu ti, buu bumbote ko mu tambika nkole wulembolo sonika kibila ki bamufundidi.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kinzonzi ki Pawuli ha ntadisi yi ntinu Angilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Angilipa wuta ku Pawuli ti: «Wuu na luve mu zonza mu nwanina nitu aku.» Pawuli wulambula kooko mu nwanina nitu andi na wuta ti: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Ntinu Angilipa, kyese kii nani bubedidi mu nwanina nitu ani ha ntadisi aku, mu misamu mimvimba mimfundidi Bayudayo, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />mu dyambu ti tomini zaba bumbote kinkulu ki Bayudayo na nyuma zawu. Ndemvokila, nakulombidi luvibudulu mu nyuwa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Bayudayo bamvimba bazebi bwedi bubeela luzingu lwani, tuka kintwenya kyani. Bazebi bwedi nakudila ha kati di kanda dyani na ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Banzebi tuka ntama, mpe tala ti batiidi, balendi ta kimbangi ti meno nedi zinganga bonso mufalisi mu kabu dikwe toma vuminanga mu ngolo Misiku mu dibundu dyeto. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Bubedidi nina fundusu mu dyambu di kivuvu kyani mu nsilulu yisa Nzambi ku matata meto. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Mpe makanda meto kumi na mole makwe sadilanga Nzambi mu vema, mpimpa na mwini, mu dyambu ti maa na kivuvu mu yena ti nsilulu beyoyo yilungidi. Ntinu, ni mu dyambu di kivuvu bekyokyo Bayudayo bamfundidi. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Nki luna yenina dyo dyambu dimpasi mu kwikila ti Nzambi kafulukisa bafwa e? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Meno bende nedi banzilanga ti mfweti nwanisa mu nzila zimvimba, nkumbu yi Yesu mwisi-Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Bwabobo mpe nedi sadilanga ku mbanza yi Yelusalemi. Natambula luve lu zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi mpe natuula mu boloko minsambidi mimingi. Bu bedi bazengilanga lufwa, meno mpe nedi singisanga. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Mu nzo zimvimba zi lusambulu zi Bayudayo, nedi lombanga babahaana kitumbu kingolo mpe nedi bakwikisanga babiika mu sa kiminu kyawu mu Yesu. Mbalu zani mu yawu zedi sanga ti nabafyetikisa natee mu zi mbanza zinzenza.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna yala mvilukulu andi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">9.1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Ni hahoho na yendila ku mbanza yi Damasi, na bumfumu bumvimba mu ntumunu yi mpeka zimfumu zi zinganga-Nzambi. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Ntinu, bu naba mu nzila, mu ntangu ha mbata, nayena kya kikingi kifuma ku yulu, kitumbu nzungidila na bakundi bani banzyetolo, kyezezi kyandi kyedi lezima kuhyoka ku lezima ku ntangu. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Tumana bwa bamvimba ha nsi, mpe nayuwa ndinga yedi nteela mu ki-Ebeleo ti: “Sawuli, Sawuli, bila nki wuna mfyetikisila e?” Mpasi zimpamba wuna yena, bonso kibulu kina vibidila mpasi zi muhangu wu mfumu andi. <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Namufuula ti: “Mfumu, ngeye ni nani e?” Wumvutudila ti: “Meno ni Yesu yondowo wu wuna fyetikisa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Kansi vumbuka na telama. Mu dyambu ti nakuyenikini mwanki wuba kisadi kyani mpe mbangi mu misamu mi yeni na mi naakulonka. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Naakukuula mu moko ma Bayudayo na ku balembolo ba Bayudayo ku nakutambikidi. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Nina kutambika mu bazibula meso, mu baduukisa mu tombe mwanki benda ku kya, mpe mu bakuula mu lulendo lu Nkadyampemba na benda ku Nzambi, mwanki batambula mu kiminu kyawu mu meno, ndemvokolo yi masumu na kikunku ki difwa, ha kimosi na bantu balongo.” »<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna zonzila kisalu kyandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Ni bwabobo ntinu Angilipa, nalembolo bisila mu tumimina mbweno beyoyo yifuma ku yulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Nalonga musamu wumbote ntete ku bantu ba mbanza yi Damasi na bantu ba mbanza yi Yelusalemi, mboki mu kizunga kimvimba ki Yuda na ku balembolo ba Bayudayo. Nabalonga bavilula madyela, bavutuka ku Nzambi na balonka mu mavanga mawu ti bavilukidi. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Musamu wawowo Bayudayo bankangila mu nzo-Nzambi, mpe basosa mu mponda. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Natee mu kilumbu bekiki, Nzambi kwandi wuna kwe nkebingi. Mpe nina tatamana mu ta kimbangi ku bantu ba mfunu na ku bantu bampamba. Nina kwe te kimbangi kihiika ko, kansi ni kyo kwandi ki samuna mimbikudi na Mose ti kya lungusu. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />Klisto waayena mpasi, waaba wuntete mu fuluka mu bafwa, mpe waasamuna kya ki mpulusu ku Bayudayo na ku balembolo ba Bayudayo.<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli lombidi ntinu Angilipa kakwikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Pawuli bu kedi nwaninanga nitu andi, Fesituse wuzonza mu ngolo ti: «Pawuli! Ngeye lahukidi, madyela makuhitidi, ni hahoho weka kilahuki!» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Kansi Pawuli wuvutula ti: «Mfumu Fesituse, nii kilahuki ko. Misamu mi nina duukisa ha munwa ani, mikedika midi na misungama.» <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Misamu mimvimba bemyomyo ntinu Angilipa mya kazebi. Ni hahoho, nina zonzila na kivuvu kimvimba ha ntadisi andi. Nkwikidi ti kuu dyambu di kalembolo zaba ko. Mu dyambu ti, mihyokila mu mansweki ko. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Ntinu Angilipa, kwikidi mu misamu mibikula mimbikudi e? Nzebi ti myakwikidi. <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Angilipa wuta ku Pawuli ti: «Ha sidi ntama ko buna nkitudi mu-Klisto.» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pawuli wuvutula ti: «Ni diba bubedidi ni diba mbazi, nina sambila Nzambi mu dyambu dyaku kaka ko, kansi mu bamvimba bebaba bana nyuwa bubedidi, lukituka bonso bu nidi, kansi balembolo kangu misinga mi bisengo.»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ntinu wutelama ha kimosi na Munyadi, na Belenise na yobobo bazakala ha kimosi nawu. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Bayenda ku mfundu na bata kuna ti: «Bakala bedidi kahidikidi dyambu dimbi ko dye muzengila lufwa hoti mu mutuula boloko.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Angilipa wuta ku Fesituse ti: «Muntu bewuwu keti baka kimpwanza tala ti kalombidi ko ti ntinu yi Loma kamufundisa.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Nyendolo yi Pawuli ku mbanza yi Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Bu babonga nzengolo mwanki twenda ku nsi yi Itali mu masuwa, bayekola Pawuli na nkole zihiika mu moko ma mfumu yimosi yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, nkumbu andi Yuliyuse, wuba mu kabu di binwani bi ntinu yi Loma. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tumaka mu masuwa ma mbanza yi Adalamite medi kwendisa ku makumu ma kizunga ki Aziya, ni tuyenda. Alisitalaki, mwisi mbanza yi Tesalonika mu kizunga ki Masedwani, wuba neto kintwadi. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Kilumbu kilanda, tutuula ha mbanza yi Sidoni. Yuliyuse wuba muntu wumbote ku Pawuli, wumuhaana luve mu yenikina bakundi bandi, mwanki kabaka bima biba nandi nsatu. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Bu tukatuka hoho, tulandila nzyetolo bela-bela na kumu di kizanga ki Sipeli, mu dyambu ti bitembo bi twedi kwe bwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Bu tumana sabuka mubu wu bizunga bi Silisi na Pamfili, ni tutuula ha mbanza yi Mila mu kizunga ki Lisi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama, bu kayena hoho masuwa ma Alezandi medi kwenda ku nsi yi Itali, ni katukotisa momo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Bilumbu bibingi tusa mu kwe yenzingi malembe-malembe mpe mu mpasi tutuudila ha nkotolo yi mbanza yi Kinide. Kitembo bu kyedi tukakidila ni tulanda nzila yihiika, ni tuhyoka nsongi yi butoto bu Salomoni mu kwe landi kumu di kizanga ki Kelete. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Nkatika mu mpasi tulandila kumu ni tutuula ha kibuka kimosi ki bakwe tumisinanga ti Mabungu-Mantoko bela-bela na mbanza yi Lasaya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Ntangu yiyingi yihyoka, mpe masuwa mayiza ba mu mpasi mu kwe yenzi, mu dyambu ti ntangu ye mina nsoki yikihyokila. Ni hahoho, Pawuli kahaanina ndwengosolo eyi: <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />«Bakundi bani, nayeni ti nzyetolo beyiyi nkatika yinsisi yaaba: masuwa na bifunda byaafukila. Mpe yeto bende, tulendi hombisa luzingu.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Kansi Mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama yi Loma wubisa mu yuwila Pawuli. Yandi wuvula yuwila kwandi kinati ki masuwa na muntu wuvwidi masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Dibungu bedyodyo, diba dimbote ko mu hyokisila nsungi yi kyozi kingolo. Ni hahoho, bantu babingi balomba nzila mu katuka hoho: bedi tya, tala ti bulendi ba, batuula ku mbanza yi Fenikise, dibungu di Kelete, ditadisa ku sude-wesete na ku node-wesete, mwanki bahyokisila nsungi yi kyozi kingolo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitembo kingolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Mwa mupepe wumosi wulembama wufuma ku sude wutona mu hehomoka, yawu babanzila ti balenda lungisa makani mawu. Ni hahoho, batombodila mu mamba kisengo ki na musinga ki kwe sikikanga masuwa na balandila bela-bela kumu di Kelete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kansi, mwa ntangu yifyoti kwandi yihyoka, kitembo kimosi kingolo, ki bakwe tumisinanga ti Elakilone kyedi kukula, kifuma ku milandu mi kizanga . <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Masuwa mayenda mu kitembo na malenda ko mu kakidila kyo. Ni tubiika kwandi ki tunata. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Tuhyokila mu banda di mwa kizanga ki Koda. Mpe mu mpasi zizingi tulendila mu sikika mulungu wuba mu masuwa wukwe vukisanga bantu. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Bu batombola mulungu mu mamba, batuula wo mu masuwa. Mboki, bazinga masuwa misinga mutoma me kindisa. Bu bedi yena bunkuta mu kwe kangama ku kumu di munyenge di makumu ma nsi yi Libi, bakulumuna kisengo kikwe sikikanga masuwa. Ni babiika kitembo kyenda banati konso-konso. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Kitembo bu kyedi tatamana mu tuningisa mu ngolo, kilumbu kilanda, ni tulosa bifunda bihiika mu mubu. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Kilumbu kitatu, balosa yawu bende mu moko mawu bisalulu bi masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Mu bilumbu bibingi, twedi bwesa yena ntangu na mbwetete ko. Kitembo kitatamana mu kukula mu ngolo, twedi bwesa kwikila ko ti twaavuuka.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Bahyokisa bilumbu bibingi balembolo dya. Ni hahoho, Pawuli bu katelama ha ntadisi awu, wuta ti: «Bakundi bani, tala ti lunyuwidingi, nganunu tukatukidingi ha Kelete ko, mwanki tulembolo fukisa na kuhombisa bima.» <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Bwabu na lulombidi lu lwata kibakala, mu dyambu ti ku muntu ko waafwa, na kima kyaahombila kaka ni masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Mu dyambu ti mu mpimpa beyiyi, mbazi yimosi yi Nzambi yi mvwidi na yi nakwe sadilanga yi nyenikiningi, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />yintedidi ti: «Pawuli, kuyenandi bunkuta ko! Fweti fundusu ha ntadisi yi Kayisali, ntinu yi Loma, mpe Nzambi wukuheeni luzingu lu bantu bamvimba bana zyeta naaku mu masuwa.» <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Bakundi bani, lwateeno kibakala, mu dyambu ti nii na kiminu mu Nzambi: «Bu kantedidi, bwabobo mpe myaahyokila. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Masuwa meto ma kwe mwangana ha kumu di kizanga kimosi.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Yiba mpimpa yi kumi na ya tuka kitembo kyedi kwe tunati ku ndambu ka ndambu yi mubu wu Meditelane. Kampe mu kati-kati di mpimpa, bisadi bi masuwa byedi banza ti tweka bela-bela na butoto. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Batuba musinga mu teza sunda yi mamba na bayena ti sunda yi mamba yidi mu zimetele makumatatu na nsambwadi. Mwa kitatu dyaka kikingi, batuba dyaka musinga mu mamba na bayena ti sunda yi mamba yidi mu zimetele makumole na nana. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Bayena bunkuta ti masuwa malendi kwe koyama mu matadi mamanene, ni hahoho, batubila ku manima ma masuwa bisengo biya bikwe sikikanga masuwa, ni bedi kingila ti bwisi bukya mu nswalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Kansi, bisadi bi masuwa bubyedi sosa mu woka, batona mu kulumuna mulungu mu mamba. Ni bahuna ti bisengo bikwe sikikanga masuwa bana sosa mu kanga ku mutwala. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pawuli ni kata ku mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama na ku zimbulu-mbulu ti: «Tala ti bantu bebaba bazakadi mu masuwa ko, lulendi vuuka ko.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Bwabobo zimbulu-mbulu zitabudila misinga myedi sikikanga mulungu, na babika wo wenda mu mamba.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Tekila bwisi bukya, Pawuli wusyamisa bamvimba biza badya na wuta ti: «Taleno, bubedidi tweka kilumbu ki kumi na ya tuka bu lutona mu kingilanga, mpe lwadidi kani kima ko. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Bwabu nina lulomba ludya, mu dyambu ti mfunu bidi mu mvuukulu eno. Ku muntu wumosi ko mu yeno waazimbisa kani mulengi wumosi wu mutu andi.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Mu mpova bezozo, wubonga dimpa, wuvutula matondo ku Nzambi ha ntadisi yi bamvimba, mboki wubukuna dyo na wutona mu dya. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Bamvimba balwata kibakala na badya mpe. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Bantu nkama zole na makumi nsambwadi na sambanu tuba mu masuwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Bu tumana yukuta, tulosa bifunda bi bele mu mubu, mwanki masuwa malenga.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masuwa mamwangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Bwisi bu bukya, bisadi bi masuwa bazaba ko nkye kibuka baba, kansi bayena kumu di munyenge. Ni babonga nzengolo ye kwe sikika masuwa hoho, tala ti bulendi ba. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Banyanguna misinga mi bisengo bikwe sikikanga masuwa, ni bayambula byo mu mubu, banyanguna mpe misinga mi zinkafi zikwe twadisanga masuwa, mboki batombola mulele wuu ku mutwala wu masuwa mwanki kitembo kibanata. Ni bayendisa ku bela kumu di munyenge. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kansi masuwa bu mayenda vwikama mu munyenge, ni makangama. Ndambu yi mutwala yi masuwa yiba yikota mu kati di munyenge, na medi bwesa lenda mu ningana ko. Ndambu yi manima ni yedi bwonzomoka mu ngolo zi bipo bi mamba. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Zimbulu-mbulu zisosa mu honda zinkole mwanki kani yimosi yilembolo woka mu saya. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kansi, mfumu yi zimbulu-mbulu nkama bu kasosa mu vuukisa Pawuli, wubadika mu sadila mayindu bemomo. Ni katuma ku yobobo bazaba mu saya, badumuka bantete mu mamba na benda baba ha butoto. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Bahiika bedi balanda ha yulu mabaya hoti ha yulu bibuku bi masuwa. Bwabobo bamvimba bavuukila na batudila ha butoto balembolo bwana dyambu.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ku Malite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Bu tumana vuuka, tuyuwa ti nkumbu yi kizanga bekyokyo: Malite. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Bisi-bwala, batubwana bumbote. Mvula bu yitona mu noka mpe kyozi bu kiba kikingi, banamika tiya tutunene na batulomba tufinama hoho. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pawuli wutoota kiko ki nkuni ziyuma na wutuula zo ku tiya. Kansi, mu dyambu di mbangasi, mpidi yimosi yiduuka na yimunamitina mu kooko. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />bisi-bwala bu bayena mpidi yina lela mu kooko kwandi, batelasana yawu na yawu ti: «Bakala bedidi, mumpondi wudi. Mpeleko, vuukidi mu mubu, kansi mfundusu yi Nzambi yina mubiika ko mu ba wumoyo.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Pawuli wusansumuna nyoka ku tiya na kayena kani mpasi ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Bantu bedi kingila nitu andi yivimba hoti katumbu fwa. Kansi, bu bakingila ntangu yiyingi, bayena ti kani dyambu di mpasi dimutudila ko. Ni basanza nzonzolo awu na bata ti: «nzambi yidi!»<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Bela-bela na kibuka bekyokyo, haba na mfuba yi munanga wuntete wu kizanga, nkumbu andi Pubiluse. Wutubwana bumbote, na wutulambikisa ku nzo andi bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tata di Pubiluse diba dilambalala ha mbuka. Yuku-yuku diba nandi na matikitiki. Pawuli wuyenda muvunga, na wusambila. Bu Kamutentika moko, ni kamunyakisa. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Ku manima, Mbevo zihiika zi kizanga bekyokyo ziyiza mpe, na zinyaka. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Batuzitisa bubwingi, mpe mu ntangu yi twedi kota mu masuwa, batuhaana bimvimba biba mfunu mu nzyetolo eto.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wutula ku mbanza yi Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Ngonda zitatu zihyoka, ni tukota dyaka mu masuwa ma mbanza yi Alezandi ma bakwe tumisinanga ti Dyosikuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dyosikuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mpila mosi ti bansimba: Kasitoli na Polusi. Mu ntangu beyoyo, bakwe salanga mu masuwa bedi babongilanga bonso zinzambi zikwe kebanga binati bi masuwa. </char></note>, mahyokisila nsungi yi kyozi kingolo ha kizanga bekyokyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tutuula ha mbanza yi Silakuze ha tuhyokisila bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kutonina hoho, tulanda kumu natee ku mbanza yi Lengiyo. Kilumbu kilanda, kitembo ki sude kitona mu kukula. Ku manima ma bilumbu byole, ni tutuula ha mbanza yi Puzolesi. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ha mbanza beyoyo, tubwana zimpangi zi tulomba tuhyokisa nawu lumingu lumvimba. Bwabobo tuyendila ku mbanza yi Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Mpangi zi mbanza yi Loma ziyuwa nsangu zeto, ziyiza tubwani natee ha zandu di Apiyuse na ha zinzo zitatu zi banzenza. Pawuli bu katumbu bayena, wutonda Nzambi na wubaka ngolo. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Bu tutuula ha mbanza yi Loma, Pawuli wutambula luve mu baka nzo ye zakalanga yandi bende na mbulu-mbulu yedi mukebanga.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli ha mbanza yi Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Bilumbu bitatu bihyoka, Pawuli wukutikisa ku nzo andi zimfumu zi Bayudayo zi mbanza yi Loma. Bu zimana yonzama, wubateela ti: «Mpangi zani, nazebi ti nahidikidi musamu wumbi ku mukangu eto ko, mpe natinguni Misiku mi zinkaka zeto ko. Kansi, ha mbanza yi Yelusalemi bankanga mpe banyekola mu moko ma bisi-Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Bu bamana mvwika byuhu, baba na mayindu me mpana kimpwanza, mu dyambu ti bambakila kibila ko kilendi sa ti banzengila lufwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Kansi, Bayudayo bambangisa, buna nabindama mu lomba bamfundisa ha ntadisi yi Kayisali, mpe naba na mayindu me funda mukangu ani ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ni hahoho, ndombidi naluyena mpe nazonza neeno. Mu dyambu di kivuvu ki Isaeli nidi wukangama mu misinga bemimi mi bisengo.» <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Bamuvutudila ti: «Tutambudi kani mukanda wumosi wufumini ku Yuda mu dyambu dyaku ko, mpe kani mpangi yimosi yi yizidi mu tuteela dyambu dimbi mu nitu aku ko. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kansi tutiidi mu yuwa mabanza maku mu munwa wu ngeye bende, mu dyambu ti tuzebi bwedi kabu bedyodyo dina bwanina mfyetokoso mu ndambu ka ndambu.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Basoola kilumbu kye kutakana na bayiza mu mpumbu yiyinene ku nzo andi. Kutonina mu mene natee mu nkokila, Pawuli, mu kinzonzi kyandi, wedi basamunina Kimfumu ki Nzambi. Mpe mu nzila yi Misiku mi Mose na Mimbikudi, wedi sosa ti bakwikila mu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Mu myo mikedi zonza, bantu bakwikila, kansi bahiika babisa mu kwikila. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ntangu ye vutuka buyifwana, bantu bedi yuwasana ko yawu na yawu. Ni hahoho Pawuli kabwesila dyambu edi: «Mpeve Yilongo wukedika kata mu munwa wu matata meno na wu mumbikudi Yesaya, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />bu kata ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Yenda wuta ku mukangu bewowo ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Luna toma yuwa, kansi luna bakula ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">Luna toma tala kansi luna yena ko,<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Mu dyambu ti mitima mi bantu bebaba myeka ngolo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bakengi makutu mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">na bazimini meso mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mwanki balembolo yena mu meso mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">balembolo yuwa mu makutu mawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">na balembolo bakula mu mitima myawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">mwanki balembolo vutuka kuu meno, mpe na banyakisa.<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Zabeeno wo bwabu ti Nzambi tambikidi mpulusu ku yobobo balembolo ba Bayudayo, yawu mbo bamuyuwa.»<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Pawuli bu kamana zonza bobo, Bayudayo bayenda na bedi kwe vutasani mungolo yawu na yawu]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pawuli wuhyokisa mvula zole zimvimba mu kati di nzo yikedi futilanga. Wedi tambulanga bantu bamvimba bedi kwizanga mu muyena. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Wedi samunanga kimfumu ki Nzambi na wedi longisanga, mu kivuvu kimvimba na mu kimpwanza, myo mitadidi Mfumu Yesu-Klisto .<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>